(470416, 45116, 772, '<td valign="top">A tough shot to compose for perspective... the time of day may have also been an option to consider here.</td>', 'A tough shot to compose for perspective... the time of day may have also been an option to consider here.', '2003-11-03 00:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
