(470426, 44947, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feeling of movement, texture, color and lighting control. I think you nailed this challenge. Good work.</td>', 'Wonderful feeling of movement, texture, color and lighting control. I think you nailed this challenge. Good work.', '2003-11-03 00:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
