(470528, 45125, 13336, '<td valign="top">this image is almost lost in the grain.  interesting choice of angle.  i would have liked to see it tilted just a little more to make the white corner in the upper left more symmetrical in its triangular shape.  it probobly would have helped make the track seem more like it was going into infinity as well.</td>', 'this image is almost lost in the grain.  interesting choice of angle.  i would have liked to see it tilted just a little more to make the white corner in the upper left more symmetrical in its triangular shape.  it probobly would have helped make the track seem more like it was going into infinity as well.', '2003-11-03 01:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(470530, 44981, 51167, '<td valign="top">Totally Amazing.  This shot is just beautiful.</td>', 'Totally Amazing.  This shot is just beautiful.', '2003-11-03 01:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(470531, 45173, 13336, '<td valign="top">there''s a fair bit of digital "noise" happening in this image that takes away from its quality.</td>', 'there''s a fair bit of digital "noise" happening in this image that takes away from its quality.', '2003-11-03 01:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(470532, 45157, 13336, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting image, but if the grapes are the subject i would have liked to have seen more of them, more in focus.</td>', 'this is an interesting image, but if the grapes are the subject i would have liked to have seen more of them, more in focus.', '2003-11-03 01:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
