(470544, 45075, 13336, '<td valign="top">merlot.  nice choice.  it took me a minute to realize it was a mirror effect.  the chopped off lines further down kind of give it away, and i think that looks like your camera above the wine glasses after a certain point, which is a bit of a drag.  i like the main composition with this bottle, the black cloth with the red napkin and the glass at the other end.  interesting.</td>', 'merlot.  nice choice.  it took me a minute to realize it was a mirror effect.  the chopped off lines further down kind of give it away, and i think that looks like your camera above the wine glasses after a certain point, which is a bit of a drag.  i like the main composition with this bottle, the black cloth with the red napkin and the glass at the other end.  interesting.', '2003-11-03 01:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(470545, 45177, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2003-11-03 01:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(470546, 45157, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2003-11-03 01:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(470547, 44897, 6130, '<td valign="top">This is good and I like it.</td>', 'This is good and I like it.', '2003-11-03 01:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(470548, 44582, 13336, '<td valign="top">it looks like you desaturated everything but the red.  i''m not sure why though.  red = frustration, perhaps?  but the rocketship paper weight looks playful, which detracts from that sense of seeing red.  interesting composition, though, and a neat idea for infinity.</td>', 'it looks like you desaturated everything but the red.  i''m not sure why though.  red = frustration, perhaps?  but the rocketship paper weight looks playful, which detracts from that sense of seeing red.  interesting composition, though, and a neat idea for infinity.', '2003-11-03 01:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(470549, 45152, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2003-11-03 01:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(470553, 44587, 13336, '<td valign="top">a tad overesposed i think - i can''t really see the upper left corner of the ball for the white wall behind it.  nice idea, though.</td>', 'a tad overesposed i think - i can''t really see the upper left corner of the ball for the white wall behind it.  nice idea, though.', '2003-11-03 02:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(470555, 45133, 13336, '<td valign="top">the distance here is too short to convey a sense of infinity.  it actually gives more of a sense of the lines ending short.  a more symetrical angle on the shot would have helped as well.  either that, or exagerate the anlge so that it goes off into the distance of the corner.</td>', 'the distance here is too short to convey a sense of infinity.  it actually gives more of a sense of the lines ending short.  a more symetrical angle on the shot would have helped as well.  either that, or exagerate the anlge so that it goes off into the distance of the corner.', '2003-11-03 02:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(470559, 45051, 6349, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool effect.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a cool effect.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-11-03 02:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
