(470673, 44981, 10170, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  To be honest, if I hadn''t seen photos similar to this in the last few days, with the Northern Lights being so amazing, I''d have had to say I thought it was a fake .... but these lights really are that amazing!  I am jealous you got to enjoy such a magnificent display .... and took such a great photo.  I love the way the buildings are lit against the black trees as well.</td>', 'Awesome.  To be honest, if I hadn''t seen photos similar to this in the last few days, with the Northern Lights being so amazing, I''d have had to say I thought it was a fake .... but these lights really are that amazing!  I am jealous you got to enjoy such a magnificent display .... and took such a great photo.  I love the way the buildings are lit against the black trees as well.', '2003-11-03 03:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
