(470718, 45104, 8522, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture. Seems a tad shoehorned into the challenge, but I''ll give it the benefit of the doubt. Exposure couldn''t be better. Love the icicles. Effective shutter speed. Stunning composition. Great sky. 10</td>', 'Amazing picture. Seems a tad shoehorned into the challenge, but I''ll give it the benefit of the doubt. Exposure couldn''t be better. Love the icicles. Effective shutter speed. Stunning composition. Great sky. 10', '2003-11-03 06:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
