(470721, 44882, 8522, '<td valign="top">An unusual and original take on Autumn leaves. Great composition. I love the artistic vision in this shot. If I were to buy any prints from DPC, this would be high on my list. I''d be interested to see it with the original colours. 10</td>', 'An unusual and original take on Autumn leaves. Great composition. I love the artistic vision in this shot. If I were to buy any prints from DPC, this would be high on my list. I''d be interested to see it with the original colours. 10', '2003-11-03 06:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(470722, 44981, 8522, '<td valign="top">Ah, I recognise this one from the forums. A stunning, opportunistic shot, my only negative is that I don''t like the houses and lights at the bottom. I love the tree silhouettes though. I think it would have looked better with the lights at the bottom cropped out, but I think others may disagree. It feels a little shoehorned into the challenge though, because my attention is drawn to the light in the sky, which is definitely not infinite. Score: 7</td>', 'Ah, I recognise this one from the forums. A stunning, opportunistic shot, my only negative is that I don''t like the houses and lights at the bottom. I love the tree silhouettes though. I think it would have looked better with the lights at the bottom cropped out, but I think others may disagree. It feels a little shoehorned into the challenge though, because my attention is drawn to the light in the sky, which is definitely not infinite. Score: 7', '2003-11-03 06:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(470726, 44888, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract. Wonderful use of light. Fits the challenge nicely. 8</td>', 'Beautiful abstract. Wonderful use of light. Fits the challenge nicely. 8', '2003-11-03 06:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(470727, 44629, 8522, '<td valign="top">Uncomfortable with use of existing artwork. 1</td>', 'Uncomfortable with use of existing artwork. 1', '2003-11-03 06:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(470728, 44484, 8522, '<td valign="top">I knew there was going to be a shot like this in here somewhere. This one is carried out amazingly well... your lighting is perfect. I don''t like the ratio of negative space though... perhaps a slightly tighter crop would have worked better. I really think that this shot needs a border here. 7</td>', 'I knew there was going to be a shot like this in here somewhere. This one is carried out amazingly well... your lighting is perfect. I don''t like the ratio of negative space though... perhaps a slightly tighter crop would have worked better. I really think that this shot needs a border here. 7', '2003-11-03 06:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(470729, 45133, 12802, '<td valign="top">This looks too heavy to the right hand side, moving an inch to the left would have made both yello lines look similar.</td>', 'This looks too heavy to the right hand side, moving an inch to the left would have made both yello lines look similar.', '2003-11-03 06:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(470730, 44724, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful title, but I usually judge a photo on it''s own terms... will it fit the challenge without the title? I''m not sure this one fits. I don''t think that the picture fits the title well anyway (apart from the obvious ''New Yorker''). Where are you showing infinite passion, or the finite hearts that yearn?<br/>It is an interesting study in geometric patterns though... maybe reflecting the orderly and rigid architecture of the city, and of the way people live in it.<br/>Score: 3</td>', 'Beautiful title, but I usually judge a photo on it''s own terms... will it fit the challenge without the title? I''m not sure this one fits. I don''t think that the picture fits the title well anyway (apart from the obvious ''New Yorker''). Where are you showing infinite passion, or the finite hearts that yearn?It is an interesting study in geometric patterns though... maybe reflecting the orderly and rigid architecture of the city, and of the way people live in it.Score: 3', '2003-11-03 06:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(470732, 45176, 12802, '<td valign="top">Tiles, could also be clear honey or toffee in square containers.  :-)</td>', 'Tiles, could also be clear honey or toffee in square containers.  :-)', '2003-11-03 06:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
