(470800, 44900, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and a great shot.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and a great shot.', '2003-11-03 07:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(470801, 44897, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like it. What is that little creature with such a long way to go?</td>', 'I like it. What is that little creature with such a long way to go?', '2003-11-03 07:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(470802, 45169, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sense of infinity would be greater if the end of the paper tucked underneath were extended to run off the left-hand bottom corner of the picture, implying that the series could go on forever (which it could).</td>', 'The sense of infinity would be greater if the end of the paper tucked underneath were extended to run off the left-hand bottom corner of the picture, implying that the series could go on forever (which it could).', '2003-11-03 07:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(470803, 44857, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, background and colors.</td>', 'Nice lighting, background and colors.', '2003-11-03 07:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(470804, 45073, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely woodland setting that lifts the picture above the cliche road going off into the distance.</td>', 'This is a lovely woodland setting that lifts the picture above the cliche road going off into the distance.', '2003-11-03 07:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(470806, 45099, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty lighting and textures, and a great rendition of the metallic reflections.</td>', 'Pretty lighting and textures, and a great rendition of the metallic reflections.', '2003-11-03 07:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(470810, 45055, 12733, '<td valign="top">The out-of-focus leaves in the background suggest a leaf cover that goes on into infinity; the out of focus leaves in the foreground are simply distracting. Sharp focus in the foreground with the maximum depth of field you could get would make this picture do more for me. The colors, textures and composition are nice.</td>', 'The out-of-focus leaves in the background suggest a leaf cover that goes on into infinity; the out of focus leaves in the foreground are simply distracting. Sharp focus in the foreground with the maximum depth of field you could get would make this picture do more for me. The colors, textures and composition are nice.', '2003-11-03 07:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(470812, 45134, 12733, '<td valign="top">The utility poles enhance the sense of infinite distance. I like the subtle colors in the sky and the great depth of field.</td>', 'The utility poles enhance the sense of infinite distance. I like the subtle colors in the sky and the great depth of field.', '2003-11-03 08:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(470813, 44904, 6536, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot. Perfect composition and lighting. 10.</td>', 'Amazing shot. Perfect composition and lighting. 10.', '2003-11-03 08:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(470814, 44649, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great three-dimensional effect. What is it?</td>', 'Great three-dimensional effect. What is it?', '2003-11-03 08:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(470815, 44582, 12061, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.</td>', 'excellent composition.', '2003-11-03 08:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(470817, 44602, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes the numbers glow and brings out the colors well. The two dominoes lying down add to the composition. Nice shot.</td>', 'The lighting makes the numbers glow and brings out the colors well. The two dominoes lying down add to the composition. Nice shot.', '2003-11-03 08:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(470818, 45087, 12733, '<td valign="top">This makes an interesting abstract study in curves and near monochrome.</td>', 'This makes an interesting abstract study in curves and near monochrome.', '2003-11-03 08:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(470821, 44522, 12733, '<td valign="top">This looks like a landscape on one of the outer planets; well done.</td>', 'This looks like a landscape on one of the outer planets; well done.', '2003-11-03 08:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(470825, 45136, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The colors of the flowers add a nice accent.</td>', 'Nice composition. The colors of the flowers add a nice accent.', '2003-11-03 08:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(470826, 45036, 13218, '<td valign="top">Excellent. wonderful. great. bravooooooooo.. Good luck. <br/>Regards, BIliana</td>', 'Excellent. wonderful. great. bravooooooooo.. Good luck. Regards, BIliana', '2003-11-03 08:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(470827, 45141, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and pretty silhouettes, but how does it relate either to infinity or to your title?</td>', 'Beautiful sky and pretty silhouettes, but how does it relate either to infinity or to your title?', '2003-11-03 08:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(470833, 45126, 6624, '<td valign="top">noticed number 1491, know the feeling of infinite things to do  somehow I don''t go too much further with this</td>', 'noticed number 1491, know the feeling of infinite things to do  somehow I don''t go too much further with this', '2003-11-03 08:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(470834, 44974, 6624, '<td valign="top">good title, nice crisp image - good response to challenge 6</td>', 'good title, nice crisp image - good response to challenge 6', '2003-11-03 08:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(470835, 44999, 12061, '<td valign="top">wonderful job! Looks like a winner .. 10</td>', 'wonderful job! Looks like a winner .. 10', '2003-11-03 08:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(470838, 44484, 6624, '<td valign="top">I have to say this is what I had intended to do and I know I would not have done it as well as this..very crisp and clean 7</td>', 'I have to say this is what I had intended to do and I know I would not have done it as well as this..very crisp and clean 7', '2003-11-03 08:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(470840, 45088, 3569, '<td valign="top">Powerlines are very distracting.</td>', 'Powerlines are very distracting.', '2003-11-03 08:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(470847, 45036, 472, '<td valign="top">this fuckin rocks hardcore dude. the colors and dof and movement - all first class. only niggle: the hole at the end might be better if it was a more perfect circle.  nonetheless, a solid 10.</td>', 'this fuckin rocks hardcore dude. the colors and dof and movement - all first class. only niggle: the hole at the end might be better if it was a more perfect circle.  nonetheless, a solid 10.', '2003-11-03 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(470851, 44963, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and photo.</td>', 'Excellent idea and photo.', '2003-11-03 09:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(470852, 45102, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. One of the best.</td>', 'Wonderful. One of the best.', '2003-11-03 09:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(470871, 45010, 11895, '<td valign="top">cropped too close on the right</td>', 'cropped too close on the right', '2003-11-03 09:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(470888, 45176, 327, '<td valign="top">Are they tiles or windows? Very neat shot.....abstract+ I get lost looking at it. Love that. Super good color. The lighting is a ?lamp or the ?sun. Very cool shot what ever it is.</td>', 'Are they tiles or windows? Very neat shot.....abstract+ I get lost looking at it. Love that. Super good color. The lighting is a ?lamp or the ?sun. Very cool shot what ever it is.', '2003-11-03 10:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(470890, 44957, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shell, looks very old. I like this shot for this challenge. I do think the lighting is good but also would of liked more dramatic lighting. The colors are awesome.</td>', 'Pretty shell, looks very old. I like this shot for this challenge. I do think the lighting is good but also would of liked more dramatic lighting. The colors are awesome.', '2003-11-03 10:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(470892, 45135, 327, '<td valign="top">Good idea, unique. The light is just a bit blown out.</td>', 'Good idea, unique. The light is just a bit blown out.', '2003-11-03 10:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(470896, 45173, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat abstract. Love the shadows and lights.</td>', 'Neat abstract. Love the shadows and lights.', '2003-11-03 10:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(470897, 45134, 327, '<td valign="top">The perfect shot of infinity. I thought there would be 50 shots of tracks. I''m glad you did this one because it''s a ''good'' shot. Love your focus, balance, and composition. This is going to be in the top three!!</td>', 'The perfect shot of infinity. I thought there would be 50 shots of tracks. I''m glad you did this one because it''s a ''good'' shot. Love your focus, balance, and composition. This is going to be in the top three!!', '2003-11-03 10:44:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(470898, 45012, 327, '<td valign="top">Only thing I can think of to say is....How pretty...wow. Love the motion of the liquid and the colors.</td>', 'Only thing I can think of to say is....How pretty...wow. Love the motion of the liquid and the colors.', '2003-11-03 10:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(470899, 44582, 327, '<td valign="top">Oh---  you math people!!!!!! :)<br/>Very good idea, original. Nice clean shot with good composition.</td>', 'Oh---  you math people!!!!!! :)Very good idea, original. Nice clean shot with good composition.', '2003-11-03 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(470900, 45113, 327, '<td valign="top">Very true.</td>', 'Very true.', '2003-11-03 10:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(470901, 45009, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I''m not sure I can add more then that. I love this. Top three I''m sure.  Very good.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I''m not sure I can add more then that. I love this. Top three I''m sure.  Very good.', '2003-11-03 10:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(470902, 44522, 327, '<td valign="top">Breath taking shot. I think it''s very pretty. The grain is the only flaw I see.</td>', 'Breath taking shot. I think it''s very pretty. The grain is the only flaw I see.', '2003-11-03 10:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(470903, 44899, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, awesome texture.</td>', 'Pretty shot, awesome texture.', '2003-11-03 10:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(470905, 44484, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s floating. Wonderful light control. Good shooting.</td>', 'Looks like it''s floating. Wonderful light control. Good shooting.', '2003-11-03 10:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(470909, 44724, 327, '<td valign="top">Poetic title. Great city, great people. I like this shot but it is busy. Light, reflection, grid and buildings. I do think you have captured the challenge.</td>', 'Poetic title. Great city, great people. I like this shot but it is busy. Light, reflection, grid and buildings. I do think you have captured the challenge.', '2003-11-03 10:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(470912, 44587, 327, '<td valign="top">Humm, white on white. Love that. Great lighting, good control. Nice clean focus.<br/>Bravo.</td>', 'Humm, white on white. Love that. Great lighting, good control. Nice clean focus.Bravo.', '2003-11-03 10:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(470914, 45128, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is sooo cool.</td>', 'Wow, this is sooo cool.', '2003-11-03 10:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(470915, 44999, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, color, tone and focus. I can only say ''congrats''!!!</td>', 'Beautiful light, color, tone and focus. I can only say ''congrats''!!!', '2003-11-03 10:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(470917, 45066, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful feeling of movement, motion. Good composition shot.</td>', 'Beautiful feeling of movement, motion. Good composition shot.', '2003-11-03 10:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(470918, 45049, 327, '<td valign="top">I hope the farmers are infinite and their fields. Wonderful composition and light.</td>', 'I hope the farmers are infinite and their fields. Wonderful composition and light.', '2003-11-03 10:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(470921, 44832, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like this is floating. Good light control and good color. This makes a statement yet it''s a simple composition. ''Less is more''.....bravo.</td>', 'Looks like this is floating. Good light control and good color. This makes a statement yet it''s a simple composition. ''Less is more''.....bravo.', '2003-11-03 10:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(470923, 44904, 327, '<td valign="top">Winner. Just awesome you got to see this!!! Wow.</td>', 'Winner. Just awesome you got to see this!!! Wow.', '2003-11-03 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(470924, 45104, 327, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Looks like a painting. Also looks really cold.</td>', 'Fantastic. Looks like a painting. Also looks really cold.', '2003-11-03 11:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(470925, 45133, 327, '<td valign="top">I think this is good, but would of liked to see the horizon in the shot.</td>', 'I think this is good, but would of liked to see the horizon in the shot.', '2003-11-03 11:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(470930, 45127, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done. Right on for the challenge.</td>', 'Well done. Right on for the challenge.', '2003-11-03 11:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(470932, 44929, 1368, '<td valign="top">Wow This is beautiful! I love how the stones goes on forever And the guy in the corner putting more emotions in the picture B&amp;W is very good here. Great job!</td>', 'Wow This is beautiful! I love how the stones goes on forever And the guy in the corner putting more emotions in the picture B&W is very good here. Great job!', '2003-11-03 11:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(470933, 45087, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow good eye. I love this composition. Your going to be in the winners cicrle with this one.....it''s just wonderful and will make a cool poster too. Neat neat shot.</td>', 'Wow good eye. I love this composition. Your going to be in the winners cicrle with this one.....it''s just wonderful and will make a cool poster too. Neat neat shot.', '2003-11-03 11:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(470934, 44537, 1368, '<td valign="top">Its a beautiful picture! May I ask how you did it?</td>', 'Its a beautiful picture! May I ask how you did it?', '2003-11-03 11:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(470936, 45096, 11895, '<td valign="top">seems to beg for a lower angle (camera closer to the ground to show a less abrupt end to the board walk) and more lightness (to have more detail at the bottom)</td>', 'seems to beg for a lower angle (camera closer to the ground to show a less abrupt end to the board walk) and more lightness (to have more detail at the bottom)', '2003-11-03 11:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(470941, 44999, 1368, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is so beautiful! Reminds me if Dali pictures I guess thats where it came from ;) The best picture in this challenge! Hope it wins! Great job! - 10</td>', 'Wow! This is so beautiful! Reminds me if Dali pictures I guess thats where it came from ;) The best picture in this challenge! Hope it wins! Great job! - 10', '2003-11-03 11:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(470942, 44970, 2223, '<td valign="top">Wow, i have some of these!  I got them from upstate NY. Where did you find yours?</td>', 'Wow, i have some of these!  I got them from upstate NY. Where did you find yours?', '2003-11-03 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(470943, 44587, 12061, '<td valign="top">a little hint of color would look nice. I love the simpleness of this shot</td>', 'a little hint of color would look nice. I love the simpleness of this shot', '2003-11-03 11:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(470944, 45097, 13756, '<td valign="top">Nice color and reflections</td>', 'Nice color and reflections', '2003-11-03 11:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(470945, 45176, 7687, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure how closely this image represents infinite, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  That being said, I think this is a beautiful image.  It looks so simple and elegant.  I''m impressed by the location of the light on the left side, it really adds an interesting dimension to this shot.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure how closely this image represents infinite, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  That being said, I think this is a beautiful image.  It looks so simple and elegant.  I''m impressed by the location of the light on the left side, it really adds an interesting dimension to this shot.', '2003-11-03 11:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(470947, 45138, 7687, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed about this image was the great contrast between the light purple background and the screen.  Of course the water beads jumped out at me as well, but the drops left me wanting to see them much closer.  I wanted to check out the detail in them, because from what I can tell, they are very beautiful.  Overall I like this shot, good work.</td>', 'The first thing I noticed about this image was the great contrast between the light purple background and the screen.  Of course the water beads jumped out at me as well, but the drops left me wanting to see them much closer.  I wanted to check out the detail in them, because from what I can tell, they are very beautiful.  Overall I like this shot, good work.', '2003-11-03 11:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(470948, 44981, 7687, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Aurora shot!  With the recent events, I figured someone would enter a shot like this.  Unfortunately I didn''t get to see it because of the cloud cover, but I can tell from your image that it was a beautiful event.  I really like how you included the trees and the house at the bottom of time image, it gives the image a strong anchor from which the Aurora can shine.  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful Aurora shot!  With the recent events, I figured someone would enter a shot like this.  Unfortunately I didn''t get to see it because of the cloud cover, but I can tell from your image that it was a beautiful event.  I really like how you included the trees and the house at the bottom of time image, it gives the image a strong anchor from which the Aurora can shine.  Beautiful shot.', '2003-11-03 11:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(470952, 45009, 11895, '<td valign="top">might have been better in color</td>', 'might have been better in color', '2003-11-03 11:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(470953, 45096, 7687, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like this.  The foreground is so amazing, it resembles a charcoal drawing.  To me, the walkway would look infinite if it ended at the top of the frame, rather than curving off to the left.  I don''t feel that the horizon/landscape helps this image very much.  If it were something amazing like mountains, then I could see keeping it.  The foreground is so simple and straight forward that it leaves me wanting the top 1/3rd of the image cropped off. <br/> <br/>I hope this helps, and congratulations on a very stunning image!<br/>Quadrajet</td>', 'Wow, I like this.  The foreground is so amazing, it resembles a charcoal drawing.  To me, the walkway would look infinite if it ended at the top of the frame, rather than curving off to the left.  I don''t feel that the horizon/landscape helps this image very much.  If it were something amazing like mountains, then I could see keeping it.  The foreground is so simple and straight forward that it leaves me wanting the top 1/3rd of the image cropped off.  I hope this helps, and congratulations on a very stunning image!Quadrajet', '2003-11-03 11:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(470954, 44619, 7687, '<td valign="top">Woah, beautiful landscape shot!  The colors in this are amazing as is the atmospheric effect...it does seemingly go on forever doesn''t it?</td>', 'Woah, beautiful landscape shot!  The colors in this are amazing as is the atmospheric effect...it does seemingly go on forever doesn''t it?', '2003-11-03 11:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(470959, 45164, 7687, '<td valign="top">Heh, I had this idea as well, but figured someone else would do it...and do it better than me. LOL   Great contrast and the DOF is superb.  A very simple and straight forward image, beautiful.</td>', 'Heh, I had this idea as well, but figured someone else would do it...and do it better than me. LOL   Great contrast and the DOF is superb.  A very simple and straight forward image, beautiful.', '2003-11-03 11:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
