(471038, 44963, 327, '<td valign="top">Makes my stomache burn to think of taking that many. lol. Good idea, nice set up. I do think your point of focus is too narrow. Still I get your idea and understand the shot, it''s good for the challenge.</td>', 'Makes my stomache burn to think of taking that many. lol. Good idea, nice set up. I do think your point of focus is too narrow. Still I get your idea and understand the shot, it''s good for the challenge.', '2003-11-03 12:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(471040, 44974, 327, '<td valign="top">That''s the truth and then some. Stunning to see all these markers lined up. Makes ya stop and think.....now if the old doofus''s that run countries could only see things this way. Good entry.</td>', 'That''s the truth and then some. Stunning to see all these markers lined up. Makes ya stop and think.....now if the old doofus''s that run countries could only see things this way. Good entry.', '2003-11-03 12:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(471041, 44984, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Love the frosty feel.</td>', 'Pretty. Love the frosty feel.', '2003-11-03 12:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
