(471581, 44522, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot! You almost look for angels, I love it 9</td>', 'This is an awesome shot! You almost look for angels, I love it 9', '2003-11-03 21:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(471582, 44968, 10848, '<td valign="top">I can tell you put alot of preparation into this shot, nice to see someone making this kind of effort, great shot and wonderful composition, love the curve of the candles , this adds depth to me. great jpb</td>', 'I can tell you put alot of preparation into this shot, nice to see someone making this kind of effort, great shot and wonderful composition, love the curve of the candles , this adds depth to me. great jpb', '2003-11-03 21:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(471585, 44981, 10848, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! This is a wonderful interpretaion of infinite to me. The beauty of nature never ceases to amaze me. I love the way you captured the gorgeous colors without the noise great job!</td>', 'Awesome shot! This is a wonderful interpretaion of infinite to me. The beauty of nature never ceases to amaze me. I love the way you captured the gorgeous colors without the noise great job!', '2003-11-03 22:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(471590, 45141, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most beautiful shots I have seen in this challenge. The colors are magnificent, the trees add wonderful depth and clarity to this shot.</td>', 'This is one of the most beautiful shots I have seen in this challenge. The colors are magnificent, the trees add wonderful depth and clarity to this shot.', '2003-11-03 22:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(471596, 44904, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot and wonderful execution of the depth of field, this is a great capture</td>', 'Great shot and wonderful execution of the depth of field, this is a great capture', '2003-11-03 22:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(471618, 45055, 11508, '<td valign="top">I want to be there, right now. The focus is so clear. I love everything about this photo, the angle of the wood rounds curving around the beach, and the sand and leaves. The people really add perspective too. You have done a great job with the composition, the colors and contrast are right on too. Great job, I can''t vote, but I would give it a 10.</td>', 'I want to be there, right now. The focus is so clear. I love everything about this photo, the angle of the wood rounds curving around the beach, and the sand and leaves. The people really add perspective too. You have done a great job with the composition, the colors and contrast are right on too. Great job, I can''t vote, but I would give it a 10.', '2003-11-03 22:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(471627, 44981, 13806, '<td valign="top">amazing natural phenomenon!<br/>9/10</td>', 'amazing natural phenomenon!9/10', '2003-11-03 22:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(471637, 45113, 6668, '<td valign="top">why aren''t the candles lit? I think it would have added another element to the shot since they are already there.</td>', 'why aren''t the candles lit? I think it would have added another element to the shot since they are already there.', '2003-11-03 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(471644, 45126, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL funny list...great idea..love the black and white..nice work!</td>', 'LOL funny list...great idea..love the black and white..nice work!', '2003-11-03 23:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(471651, 44929, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice idea...the only problem I have with this shot is that dates on the tombstone, and by looking at the boy...it doesn''t seem believable that he had even know this women...she may be a relative but is level of sadness or "infitinite sadness" doesn''t seem real to me if that makes sense... The black and white works well with this shot, though I think it would have also been better without the thick black border. 6</td>', 'Nice idea...the only problem I have with this shot is that dates on the tombstone, and by looking at the boy...it doesn''t seem believable that he had even know this women...she may be a relative but is level of sadness or "infitinite sadness" doesn''t seem real to me if that makes sense... The black and white works well with this shot, though I think it would have also been better without the thick black border. 6', '2003-11-03 23:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(471665, 45125, 6668, '<td valign="top">photo is way to grainy to be able to see any detail...I am not sure if this is how you intended it or not...but it does not work well in my opinion.</td>', 'photo is way to grainy to be able to see any detail...I am not sure if this is how you intended it or not...but it does not work well in my opinion.', '2003-11-03 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(471669, 45066, 12339, '<td valign="top">I like the use of black and white.  This does look like your light wave could go on in fan itum.</td>', 'I like the use of black and white.  This does look like your light wave could go on in fan itum.', '2003-11-04 00:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(471670, 45172, 12339, '<td valign="top">I love the colours and use of light.</td>', 'I love the colours and use of light.', '2003-11-04 00:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(471671, 44958, 12339, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humour.</td>', 'Good sense of humour.', '2003-11-04 00:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(471672, 45009, 12339, '<td valign="top">The black and white emphasizes the mood of this picture.  Like the  curve of the wood.</td>', 'The black and white emphasizes the mood of this picture.  Like the  curve of the wood.', '2003-11-04 00:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(471674, 44921, 12339, '<td valign="top">I could really go there!!  I like the way the colour is faded and blurred while other chocolates are clear - too clear (I could really go for some chocoate).</td>', 'I could really go there!!  I like the way the colour is faded and blurred while other chocolates are clear - too clear (I could really go for some chocoate).', '2003-11-04 00:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(471676, 45012, 12339, '<td valign="top">Great colours and composition.</td>', 'Great colours and composition.', '2003-11-04 00:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(471678, 45177, 12339, '<td valign="top">I love the soft lighting and feather touch to these grasses.</td>', 'I love the soft lighting and feather touch to these grasses.', '2003-11-04 00:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(471679, 45075, 12339, '<td valign="top">Very original phto.  I love the colour and the lining up of, really, everything.</td>', 'Very original phto.  I love the colour and the lining up of, really, everything.', '2003-11-04 00:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(471680, 44897, 12339, '<td valign="top">Poor little guy.  the colours of the caterpillar are good.  I like the angle of your picture as well.</td>', 'Poor little guy.  the colours of the caterpillar are good.  I like the angle of your picture as well.', '2003-11-04 00:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(471682, 45104, 12339, '<td valign="top">This is infinitely icy.  The black and white add the mood (frozen mood).</td>', 'This is infinitely icy.  The black and white add the mood (frozen mood).', '2003-11-04 00:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(471683, 44957, 12339, '<td valign="top">The colours of this spiral shell are awsome.  The lighting is great as well.</td>', 'The colours of this spiral shell are awsome.  The lighting is great as well.', '2003-11-04 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(471716, 45125, 7687, '<td valign="top">This is such a dynamic shot!  From the great angle/composition to the grain, I think this is one of the better images in the contest.  BTW, I feel the black and white works perfectly.  Great shot!</td>', 'This is such a dynamic shot!  From the great angle/composition to the grain, I think this is one of the better images in the contest.  BTW, I feel the black and white works perfectly.  Great shot!', '2003-11-04 01:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(471727, 45009, 3351, '<td valign="top">beautiful<br/></td>', 'beautiful', '2003-11-04 01:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(471728, 45096, 3351, '<td valign="top">this is a gorgeous perspective<br/></td>', 'this is a gorgeous perspective', '2003-11-04 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(471729, 44522, 3351, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely amazing. i only wish there werent glare</td>', 'this is absolutely amazing. i only wish there werent glare', '2003-11-04 01:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(471730, 44537, 3351, '<td valign="top">whoa. holy crap! i like it.</td>', 'whoa. holy crap! i like it.', '2003-11-04 01:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(471742, 45101, 7687, '<td valign="top">From the "endless" sky and the soaring bird, to spires reaching towards the heavens, you have a few different ways to represent "infinite".  The black and white works perfectly while the amount of contrast in the sky is absolutely amazing.  This is a nice shot!</td>', 'From the "endless" sky and the soaring bird, to spires reaching towards the heavens, you have a few different ways to represent "infinite".  The black and white works perfectly while the amount of contrast in the sky is absolutely amazing.  This is a nice shot!', '2003-11-04 03:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(471751, 44897, 10084, '<td valign="top">Works for me. I love that you were able to capture the concrete on the road. Incredible focus really gives you a sense of the texture of the road. The white line really helps to lead your eyes from right to the far left. Very effective shot.</td>', 'Works for me. I love that you were able to capture the concrete on the road. Incredible focus really gives you a sense of the texture of the road. The white line really helps to lead your eyes from right to the far left. Very effective shot.', '2003-11-04 04:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(471752, 45010, 7687, '<td valign="top">You''ve achieved one of the more interesting versions of this somewhat cliche subject matter.  I''m very fond of this sort of composition when dealing with rail road tracks, it''s not the same old "down the middle" shot.  I have to mention the wood in the foreground, very nice touch, it adds a visual "anchor" to the shot, giving the eye a solid starting point.  Nice work!</td>', 'You''ve achieved one of the more interesting versions of this somewhat cliche subject matter.  I''m very fond of this sort of composition when dealing with rail road tracks, it''s not the same old "down the middle" shot.  I have to mention the wood in the foreground, very nice touch, it adds a visual "anchor" to the shot, giving the eye a solid starting point.  Nice work!', '2003-11-04 04:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(471753, 44537, 7687, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool...let me guess, a spinning globe (of some sort) and the background is black paper with holes punched in it?<br/> <br/>Cool composition and colors.  Since this looks a bit like Jupiter (to me) It might have been intersting to put a couple of red spots on the globe and try to capture one of them as they passed by the camera.  Eh, just an idea.</td>', 'This is pretty cool...let me guess, a spinning globe (of some sort) and the background is black paper with holes punched in it? Cool composition and colors.  Since this looks a bit like Jupiter (to me) It might have been intersting to put a couple of red spots on the globe and try to capture one of them as they passed by the camera.  Eh, just an idea.', '2003-11-04 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(471754, 45012, 10084, '<td valign="top">The colors are incredibly vibrant. Love the different hues in the waterflows. The red/orange/yellows absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'The colors are incredibly vibrant. Love the different hues in the waterflows. The red/orange/yellows absolutely beautiful.', '2003-11-04 04:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(471755, 44587, 7687, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept for infinity...I agree it fits well as does the high key lighting.  I like how you''ve composed the string winding into the foreground and off to the background on the right.  The way the string ball is wound adds an interesting texture to the image.  Nice shot!<br/> <br/>Quadrajet</td>', 'Interesting concept for infinity...I agree it fits well as does the high key lighting.  I like how you''ve composed the string winding into the foreground and off to the background on the right.  The way the string ball is wound adds an interesting texture to the image.  Nice shot! Quadrajet', '2003-11-04 04:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(471757, 44537, 10084, '<td valign="top">Must be a spinning globe with a star background using a longer exposure. Nicely done. The blue Equator gave it away. This is such a cool idea. <br/> <br/>Compostion is perfect. Really gives you a sense that you are in space. Wished that the background was darker(needs more black). Otherwise this is a excellent shot.<br/></td>', 'Must be a spinning globe with a star background using a longer exposure. Nicely done. The blue Equator gave it away. This is such a cool idea.  Compostion is perfect. Really gives you a sense that you are in space. Wished that the background was darker(needs more black). Otherwise this is a excellent shot.', '2003-11-04 04:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(471758, 44522, 7687, '<td valign="top">Wow, those are some beautiful clouds!  I like the subject, very interesting and has great depth to it.  At first I thought I could see some lens flare in the middle of the image, but upon further inspection, it appears to be your cameras reflection in the glass.  Of course with the sun shining in, it''s almost impossible to avoid reflections like this.  You did very well with the resources you had at your disposal.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Wow, those are some beautiful clouds!  I like the subject, very interesting and has great depth to it.  At first I thought I could see some lens flare in the middle of the image, but upon further inspection, it appears to be your cameras reflection in the glass.  Of course with the sun shining in, it''s almost impossible to avoid reflections like this.  You did very well with the resources you had at your disposal.  Nice shot!', '2003-11-04 04:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(471759, 45055, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very impressive depth of field. Incredible focusing.Looking at this really gives me the goosebumps. You know that feeling when a cold wind blows and hits your skin. This gives me a great feeling of autumn/fall.<br/>I like how your eyes are lead by the wood road from the bottom left to the upper right.</td>', 'Very impressive depth of field. Incredible focusing.Looking at this really gives me the goosebumps. You know that feeling when a cold wind blows and hits your skin. This gives me a great feeling of autumn/fall.I like how your eyes are lead by the wood road from the bottom left to the upper right.', '2003-11-04 04:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(471776, 44619, 12901, '<td valign="top">What an amazing shot, i love the colours in this, love the feeling of adventure that comes with this shot. Love it!</td>', 'What an amazing shot, i love the colours in this, love the feeling of adventure that comes with this shot. Love it!', '2003-11-04 05:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(471777, 44484, 7687, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice for a subject and great presentation.  I too had thought of a mobius loop, but couldn''t come up with a suitable way to represent it.  The midtones in this shot are fantastic, subtle greys, wonderful highlights and great contrast with the black background.  I like it!</td>', 'Excellent choice for a subject and great presentation.  I too had thought of a mobius loop, but couldn''t come up with a suitable way to represent it.  The midtones in this shot are fantastic, subtle greys, wonderful highlights and great contrast with the black background.  I like it!', '2003-11-04 05:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(471778, 44582, 7687, '<td valign="top">Heh, nice concept!  I like how you have all the extra stuff in there, calculator, crumpled paper, open pen...especially the coffee stain!  Interesting how the paper on top pretty much square with the frame of the image, almost like it''s the only sane thing in the shot and it''s being subjected to the insanity written on it.  Bah, now I''m just rambling.  Nice concept and execution!</td>', 'Heh, nice concept!  I like how you have all the extra stuff in there, calculator, crumpled paper, open pen...especially the coffee stain!  Interesting how the paper on top pretty much square with the frame of the image, almost like it''s the only sane thing in the shot and it''s being subjected to the insanity written on it.  Bah, now I''m just rambling.  Nice concept and execution!', '2003-11-04 05:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(471779, 44468, 7687, '<td valign="top">Great idea, perfect for an infinite contest!  I like the idea of using tubing for this challenge although I can see that you had to use pliers (or a vise?) to get it bent around properly.  Black and white was a good choice for this image, if for no other reason than it''s a rather colorless subject.<br/> <br/>I guess my only real critique of this image would be harsh shadow behind the tubing.  It almost mimics the shape, which isn''t a BAD thing but doesn''t really add to the image (imho).<br/> <br/>I hope this helps,<br/>Quadrajet<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-24 07:26:33.</i></td>', 'Great idea, perfect for an infinite contest!  I like the idea of using tubing for this challenge although I can see that you had to use pliers (or a vise?) to get it bent around properly.  Black and white was a good choice for this image, if for no other reason than it''s a rather colorless subject. I guess my only real critique of this image would be harsh shadow behind the tubing.  It almost mimics the shape, which isn''t a BAD thing but doesn''t really add to the image (imho). I hope this helps,Quadrajet', '2003-11-04 05:58:30.000000', '2003-11-24 07:26:33.000000', 1),
