(472398, 45073, 11134, '<td valign="top">Hard to say now, but if you had taken this during a different time of day, you would have gotten some amazing yellows through the trees.  plus, maybe if you tried standing to one side of the road and got down lower it would help give a nice perspective to it</td>', 'Hard to say now, but if you had taken this during a different time of day, you would have gotten some amazing yellows through the trees.  plus, maybe if you tried standing to one side of the road and got down lower it would help give a nice perspective to it', '2003-11-04 19:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(472399, 44921, 11134, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the lines in this, I like the short depth of field.  Plus, I like the subject ;)  Fits the challenge well</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the lines in this, I like the short depth of field.  Plus, I like the subject ;)  Fits the challenge well', '2003-11-04 19:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(472400, 45135, 11134, '<td valign="top">too dark, needs more contrast with the etched in numbers, and it might look better by looking at it from more of an angle</td>', 'too dark, needs more contrast with the etched in numbers, and it might look better by looking at it from more of an angle', '2003-11-04 19:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(472403, 45019, 11134, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, you''ve really just confused me on this one.  I don''t like being able to see the red pins, I don''t like the light being focused on the center, maybe try getting the whole picture to glow, and try to add texture through either the onion rings themselves, or the background</td>', 'Hmmm, you''ve really just confused me on this one.  I don''t like being able to see the red pins, I don''t like the light being focused on the center, maybe try getting the whole picture to glow, and try to add texture through either the onion rings themselves, or the background', '2003-11-04 19:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(472406, 44896, 11134, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows in this.  Good choice for time of day.  A little more yellow to this picture would have helped a lot, in my opinion</td>', 'I like the shadows in this.  Good choice for time of day.  A little more yellow to this picture would have helped a lot, in my opinion', '2003-11-04 19:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(472408, 45098, 11134, '<td valign="top">Horizon seems cantered here....  and the telephone wires came out choppy, along with the telephone pole.  I like the subject for it, though personally i would have probably shot this a little lower...</td>', 'Horizon seems cantered here....  and the telephone wires came out choppy, along with the telephone pole.  I like the subject for it, though personally i would have probably shot this a little lower...', '2003-11-04 19:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(472411, 44900, 11134, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it doesn''t come out looking very professional....  it''s rather dark, and choppy.</td>', 'Good idea, but it doesn''t come out looking very professional....  it''s rather dark, and choppy.', '2003-11-04 19:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(472423, 45121, 11134, '<td valign="top">i like the purple, but it''s a bit too dark, and might have looked better if it was a little closer to the hands</td>', 'i like the purple, but it''s a bit too dark, and might have looked better if it was a little closer to the hands', '2003-11-04 19:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(472427, 44907, 11134, '<td valign="top">tripod would have helped here.   it''s getting too dark outside, and would have been interesting if you''d shot this from close to the ground</td>', 'tripod would have helped here.   it''s getting too dark outside, and would have been interesting if you''d shot this from close to the ground', '2003-11-04 19:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(472430, 44484, 11134, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge perfectly.  Loop is centered, well-lit, overall composition is very good</td>', 'Fits the challenge perfectly.  Loop is centered, well-lit, overall composition is very good', '2003-11-04 19:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(472432, 44832, 11134, '<td valign="top">reflection detracts from this.  if the reflection was done with artificial lighting, it may have come out a little crisper</td>', 'reflection detracts from this.  if the reflection was done with artificial lighting, it may have come out a little crisper', '2003-11-04 19:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(472436, 44574, 11134, '<td valign="top">Picture looks blurry instead of soft.  good idea, but it feels crowded instead of a closeup</td>', 'Picture looks blurry instead of soft.  good idea, but it feels crowded instead of a closeup', '2003-11-04 19:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(472439, 44602, 11134, '<td valign="top">Very nice, fits the challenge well.  I like the colors in this, and the depth of field is perfect.  this came out looking very professional.  I just wish it could have felt "crisper"</td>', 'Very nice, fits the challenge well.  I like the colors in this, and the depth of field is perfect.  this came out looking very professional.  I just wish it could have felt "crisper"', '2003-11-04 19:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(472453, 44897, 11134, '<td valign="top">Very well done road shot.  this one came out well, I like it.  My only suggestion is if the wooly caterpillar was placed in the lower left hand third instead of close to center.  Good shot.  9</td>', 'Very well done road shot.  this one came out well, I like it.  My only suggestion is if the wooly caterpillar was placed in the lower left hand third instead of close to center.  Good shot.  9', '2003-11-04 19:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(472456, 44556, 11134, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, this is very similar to the picture I submitted.  We both needed a stronger focal point, a subject that really stands out.</td>', 'Hmmm, this is very similar to the picture I submitted.  We both needed a stronger focal point, a subject that really stands out.', '2003-11-04 19:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(472459, 45036, 11134, '<td valign="top">Oooooohhh.... My first 10.  I like it a lot.  Depth of field is good, Colors are very nice, gives a space-like effect to it.  I also like the Escher-esque change from an 8 to the infinity symbol.  good job</td>', 'Oooooohhh.... My first 10.  I like it a lot.  Depth of field is good, Colors are very nice, gives a space-like effect to it.  I also like the Escher-esque change from an 8 to the infinity symbol.  good job', '2003-11-04 19:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(472462, 44935, 11134, '<td valign="top">Good choice on black and white for this shot, it improved the picture a lot.  She seems a little out of focus, and the number of mirrors is a little overwhelming from this angle</td>', 'Good choice on black and white for this shot, it improved the picture a lot.  She seems a little out of focus, and the number of mirrors is a little overwhelming from this angle', '2003-11-04 19:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(472463, 44970, 11134, '<td valign="top">Good subject, though i think it would have looked better with less of a shadow behind it.  It feels like a basic picture right now, nothing really special about it that jumps out at my eye</td>', 'Good subject, though i think it would have looked better with less of a shadow behind it.  It feels like a basic picture right now, nothing really special about it that jumps out at my eye', '2003-11-04 19:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(472464, 45075, 11134, '<td valign="top">Ah ha, my second 10.  Good job.  I like the fact that there is a horizon to this indoor shot.  great shot.</td>', 'Ah ha, my second 10.  Good job.  I like the fact that there is a horizon to this indoor shot.  great shot.', '2003-11-04 19:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(472469, 45104, 11134, '<td valign="top">Wow, a seemingly boring set of entries for this challenge is rapidly improving.  the infinite winter part is a bit of a stretch for this challenge, but wow, this is a fantastic shot.  it feels like a painting to me.  The softness to this picture is perfect, the elements of a good photo are all there, I think I''m going to look at more of your work now...  oh yeah, 10</td>', 'Wow, a seemingly boring set of entries for this challenge is rapidly improving.  the infinite winter part is a bit of a stretch for this challenge, but wow, this is a fantastic shot.  it feels like a painting to me.  The softness to this picture is perfect, the elements of a good photo are all there, I think I''m going to look at more of your work now...  oh yeah, 10', '2003-11-04 19:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(472471, 44947, 11134, '<td valign="top">Good composition, subject is well in focus, but this doesn''t really grab my attention.  strangely, it feels rather bland to me.  maybe some negative space would change my opinion</td>', 'Good composition, subject is well in focus, but this doesn''t really grab my attention.  strangely, it feels rather bland to me.  maybe some negative space would change my opinion', '2003-11-04 19:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(472474, 45130, 11134, '<td valign="top">Beautiful day at the beach.  My only problem is that i''d like to see a nice subject in the foreground.</td>', 'Beautiful day at the beach.  My only problem is that i''d like to see a nice subject in the foreground.', '2003-11-04 19:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(472478, 44888, 11134, '<td valign="top">light is really bright, and very spotlit.  i would have like a more resonating glow to this one</td>', 'light is really bright, and very spotlit.  i would have like a more resonating glow to this one', '2003-11-04 19:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(472480, 45152, 11134, '<td valign="top">I feel bummed for you that that was all you got for clouds that night!  Well composed shot, very dark though.  that long grass is very nice and turned out perfectly for this photo though</td>', 'I feel bummed for you that that was all you got for clouds that night!  Well composed shot, very dark though.  that long grass is very nice and turned out perfectly for this photo though', '2003-11-04 19:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(472485, 45088, 11134, '<td valign="top">this certainly fits the challenge, but wow, i feel bored just looking at this.  Hmmm, maybe level the horizon, go forward past the telephone wires, and take the shot from ground level.</td>', 'this certainly fits the challenge, but wow, i feel bored just looking at this.  Hmmm, maybe level the horizon, go forward past the telephone wires, and take the shot from ground level.', '2003-11-04 20:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(472488, 45156, 11134, '<td valign="top">I like seeing trees to represents infinite.  I like the colors, this picture came out well.  I can''t think of anything really to change, maybe a view of these trees from behind the roots of another one?  that would probably look really good  8</td>', 'I like seeing trees to represents infinite.  I like the colors, this picture came out well.  I can''t think of anything really to change, maybe a view of these trees from behind the roots of another one?  that would probably look really good  8', '2003-11-04 20:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(472494, 44994, 11134, '<td valign="top">I get what you''re going for here, but it doesn''t feel very infinite to me.  The photo composition is outstanding though, the water is soft, and the support beams are all very crisp.  the shadows are outstanding, and i like the angle you shot this from.  hmmmm, 9</td>', 'I get what you''re going for here, but it doesn''t feel very infinite to me.  The photo composition is outstanding though, the water is soft, and the support beams are all very crisp.  the shadows are outstanding, and i like the angle you shot this from.  hmmmm, 9', '2003-11-04 20:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(472498, 45096, 12862, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best photographs I have ever seen---ARC024</td>', 'This is one of the best photographs I have ever seen---ARC024', '2003-11-04 20:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(472501, 45136, 12311, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  It does seem as though the headstones go on forever.</td>', 'Nice composition.  It does seem as though the headstones go on forever.', '2003-11-04 20:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(472506, 44961, 9146, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the store lighting is a little harsh.<br/> <br/>it did make me smile</td>', 'I like the concept but the store lighting is a little harsh. it did make me smile', '2003-11-04 20:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(472508, 44958, 9146, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the harsh store lighting, however the concept made me smile. funnier might have been a wall of condoms with the same title</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the harsh store lighting, however the concept made me smile. funnier might have been a wall of condoms with the same title', '2003-11-04 20:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(472529, 44904, 4767, '<td valign="top">W O W ! ! !  NICE take on this challenge!  YOU were in the right place at the right time and...  oh my, that is amazing!</td>', 'W O W ! ! !  NICE take on this challenge!  YOU were in the right place at the right time and...  oh my, that is amazing!', '2003-11-04 21:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
