(472534, 44578, 4767, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot!  That corn is beautiful - well seen, well shot, well exposed.  Very nice photo!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!  That corn is beautiful - well seen, well shot, well exposed.  Very nice photo!', '2003-11-04 21:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
