(473088, 45115, 13403, '<td valign="top">yes time.. time..  what a dimension time is.      inescapable..  one can''t even begin to imagine the inexistence of time.    it is impossible.       you can''t travel through time if you can''t manipulate time itself.   it can''t be possible.    well, you can travel forward at a set speed i suppose..   time is so goddamn intriguing.</td>', 'yes time.. time..  what a dimension time is.      inescapable..  one can''t even begin to imagine the inexistence of time.    it is impossible.       you can''t travel through time if you can''t manipulate time itself.   it can''t be possible.    well, you can travel forward at a set speed i suppose..   time is so goddamn intriguing.', '2003-11-05 04:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(473090, 45006, 13403, '<td valign="top">interesting concept.</td>', 'interesting concept.', '2003-11-05 04:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(473091, 45134, 13403, '<td valign="top">no way.. its about the destination for sure.  like..  if i want to go see a movie.. i''m not all about the walk to the theater..    i''m only walking to go see a movie..   right there, i found the flaw in your statement.   take that!   haha, i''m only joking of course.</td>', 'no way.. its about the destination for sure.  like..  if i want to go see a movie.. i''m not all about the walk to the theater..    i''m only walking to go see a movie..   right there, i found the flaw in your statement.   take that!   haha, i''m only joking of course.', '2003-11-05 04:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(473095, 44502, 13403, '<td valign="top">sure, pull my heartstrings.. don''t you think this is a little cheap?   you have to find power in imagery where it shouldn''t exist.. that''s the most interesting thing to look at.. this is a photo of something that people can walk up to and see any time of day or night.   its gripping, sure.  its tragic and its sad.   but something infinitely more priceless would be to capture actual emotion.  i''m sorry.. its a good picture.. apparantly i''m just mean :-/</td>', 'sure, pull my heartstrings.. don''t you think this is a little cheap?   you have to find power in imagery where it shouldn''t exist.. that''s the most interesting thing to look at.. this is a photo of something that people can walk up to and see any time of day or night.   its gripping, sure.  its tragic and its sad.   but something infinitely more priceless would be to capture actual emotion.  i''m sorry.. its a good picture.. apparantly i''m just mean :-/', '2003-11-05 04:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(473097, 45130, 13403, '<td valign="top">riiight..     THERE!  you can see it on the lower left hand corner.  oh wait..  no, that''s just dirt on my monitor.. i dunno..  where DID you leave that damn bottle?</td>', 'riiight..     THERE!  you can see it on the lower left hand corner.  oh wait..  no, that''s just dirt on my monitor.. i dunno..  where DID you leave that damn bottle?', '2003-11-05 04:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
