(473109, 44999, 13403, '<td valign="top">i don''t know who coined ''the sands of time''   i''m sure it had to do with an hourglass..   or something to do with archaeology.. but i always used to prefer ''the stains of time''..     great photo. great color contrast.   kudos.</td>', 'i don''t know who coined ''the sands of time''   i''m sure it had to do with an hourglass..   or something to do with archaeology.. but i always used to prefer ''the stains of time''..     great photo. great color contrast.   kudos.', '2003-11-05 04:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
