(474565, 44619, 11487, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I like how the colors change with distance.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I like how the colors change with distance.  Good job.', '2003-11-05 19:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(474568, 44968, 11487, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have been better if you couldn''t see the mirror frame.</td>', 'I think this shot would have been better if you couldn''t see the mirror frame.', '2003-11-05 19:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(474574, 45104, 11487, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Has a dreamy quality.  Not sure it meets the challenge all that well, but very well done.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Has a dreamy quality.  Not sure it meets the challenge all that well, but very well done.', '2003-11-05 19:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(474605, 45161, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice light and clouds - but such soft focus - too hazy for me. The composition draws our eyes to the bright sun, but is is so bright there is nothing to see - perhaps this is infinite, but I find it frustrating.</td>', 'nice light and clouds - but such soft focus - too hazy for me. The composition draws our eyes to the bright sun, but is is so bright there is nothing to see - perhaps this is infinite, but I find it frustrating.', '2003-11-05 20:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(474609, 45077, 7628, '<td valign="top">The curvy lines of the ice are beautiful.  I like your interpretaion of infintie.  The odd blue line on the background ice is from too much sharpening? I do like your DOF.</td>', 'The curvy lines of the ice are beautiful.  I like your interpretaion of infintie.  The odd blue line on the background ice is from too much sharpening? I do like your DOF.', '2003-11-05 20:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(474612, 45099, 7628, '<td valign="top">A lovely clock.  Nice to show the passage of time.  Wish it were sharper, and I''m a bit distracted by the reflections (?) at the top of the clock.</td>', 'A lovely clock.  Nice to show the passage of time.  Wish it were sharper, and I''m a bit distracted by the reflections (?) at the top of the clock.', '2003-11-05 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(474613, 44899, 7628, '<td valign="top">An interesting interpretation, you have an eye for light and details.  I do find my eyes overwhelmed by all the detail without cohesive meaning.  Yes it is infinite - but a bit too much?</td>', 'An interesting interpretation, you have an eye for light and details.  I do find my eyes overwhelmed by all the detail without cohesive meaning.  Yes it is infinite - but a bit too much?', '2003-11-05 20:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(474616, 44935, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cute - lots of personality, and a great idea for infinite. Wish her legs were included in the bottom of the frame - or perhaps you could crop it so her head is on that "maguc" rule of thirds line?</td>', 'Cute - lots of personality, and a great idea for infinite. Wish her legs were included in the bottom of the frame - or perhaps you could crop it so her head is on that "maguc" rule of thirds line?', '2003-11-05 20:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(474621, 44537, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wonderful illusion - a spinning globe? Black background with pin holes?  very nice image.  I like the composition with the planet facing up into the infinite.  fun.</td>', 'Wonderful illusion - a spinning globe? Black background with pin holes?  very nice image.  I like the composition with the planet facing up into the infinite.  fun.', '2003-11-05 20:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(474623, 45115, 7628, '<td valign="top">Colorful time - the composition is well balanced, what would it look like if all those dials were spinning?</td>', 'Colorful time - the composition is well balanced, what would it look like if all those dials were spinning?', '2003-11-05 20:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(474625, 45055, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the dof making the leaves blur into the distance, but I wish the dof was great enough to make the foreground leaves sharp too.  Nice curve of the path leading our eyes out of the picture.</td>', 'I like the dof making the leaves blur into the distance, but I wish the dof was great enough to make the foreground leaves sharp too.  Nice curve of the path leading our eyes out of the picture.', '2003-11-05 20:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(474630, 45126, 7628, '<td valign="top">I feel your pain - no, truely!  They do go on forever!  Very humorous, I like the stark light, definitely makes me feel that daunting long list, I like how the dof makes the words go out of focus as they go off the page adding to that never ending feeling.  Simple, but well thought out.</td>', 'I feel your pain - no, truely!  They do go on forever!  Very humorous, I like the stark light, definitely makes me feel that daunting long list, I like how the dof makes the words go out of focus as they go off the page adding to that never ending feeling.  Simple, but well thought out.', '2003-11-05 20:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(474632, 44981, 5792, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is the best image in the challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion this is the best image in the challenge.', '2003-11-05 20:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(474634, 45012, 7628, '<td valign="top">Such lovely colors, very tropical.  Nice flowing water, and the dof creates a nice background.  The composition seems a bit random to me  - I''d like to see more of where the water is going?</td>', 'Such lovely colors, very tropical.  Nice flowing water, and the dof creates a nice background.  The composition seems a bit random to me  - I''d like to see more of where the water is going?', '2003-11-05 20:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(474636, 44484, 7628, '<td valign="top">fabulous lighting.  Very three dimensional, lovely gradient.  I wonder how it would look with the strip on the diagonal?  8</td>', 'fabulous lighting.  Very three dimensional, lovely gradient.  I wonder how it would look with the strip on the diagonal?  8', '2003-11-05 20:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(474637, 44502, 5792, '<td valign="top">The quality of your image honors those lost. Great job.</td>', 'The quality of your image honors those lost. Great job.', '2003-11-05 20:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(474703, 45066, 12311, '<td valign="top">Definitely an impression of infinite distance.  Well done!</td>', 'Definitely an impression of infinite distance.  Well done!', '2003-11-05 22:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(474752, 45049, 7969, '<td valign="top">how did you get this effect?  It is an interesting image.  I like the colors and the composition.</td>', 'how did you get this effect?  It is an interesting image.  I like the colors and the composition.', '2003-11-05 22:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(474755, 44990, 7969, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation, and well done at getting the silky water effect.</td>', 'Good interpretation, and well done at getting the silky water effect.', '2003-11-05 22:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(474757, 44984, 7969, '<td valign="top">The fog is wonderful in your shot, is there also snow on some trees?</td>', 'The fog is wonderful in your shot, is there also snow on some trees?', '2003-11-05 22:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(474758, 45009, 7969, '<td valign="top">Excellent job, great tones, cloudy feel of day really adds to shot.  good work</td>', 'Excellent job, great tones, cloudy feel of day really adds to shot.  good work', '2003-11-05 22:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(474761, 45096, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like your shot, it appears to be a boardwalk in the middle of a field, in the middle of nowhere, I am certainly curious about this location.  Well done.</td>', 'I like your shot, it appears to be a boardwalk in the middle of a field, in the middle of nowhere, I am certainly curious about this location.  Well done.', '2003-11-05 22:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(474765, 45104, 7969, '<td valign="top">What a spot, makes me cold just looking at it. I love the icicles in the foreground and the little house in the midground.  This shot really looks like it is a painting vs, photo it has a real surrealism feel to it IMO.  Excellent work.</td>', 'What a spot, makes me cold just looking at it. I love the icicles in the foreground and the little house in the midground.  This shot really looks like it is a painting vs, photo it has a real surrealism feel to it IMO.  Excellent work.', '2003-11-05 22:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(474768, 45138, 7969, '<td valign="top">Fences are sort of plain things, yet I really like shots of them and often take them myself.  I love the color background and the water droplets of course add so  much to this shot.  Nice work, my only possible critque would be maybe need  a focal point of some kind, but maybe not.  Just an idea.</td>', 'Fences are sort of plain things, yet I really like shots of them and often take them myself.  I love the color background and the water droplets of course add so  much to this shot.  Nice work, my only possible critque would be maybe need  a focal point of some kind, but maybe not.  Just an idea.', '2003-11-05 22:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(474770, 44999, 7969, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, what did you use?</td>', 'Good lighting, what did you use?', '2003-11-05 22:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(474773, 44855, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like this abstract and colors and comp are great, the white line over the black mass on right really adds to your shot IMO. Well done!</td>', 'I like this abstract and colors and comp are great, the white line over the black mass on right really adds to your shot IMO. Well done!', '2003-11-05 22:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(474775, 45156, 7969, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, beautiful, the color is especially pleasing.</td>', 'Simple, elegant, beautiful, the color is especially pleasing.', '2003-11-05 22:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(474778, 44981, 7969, '<td valign="top">Spectacular capture of the northern lights, (i am assuming). I like the way the light falls on the yellow house as well.  I hope you will tell us where you were when took this.  :  )</td>', 'Spectacular capture of the northern lights, (i am assuming). I like the way the light falls on the yellow house as well.  I hope you will tell us where you were when took this.  :  )', '2003-11-05 22:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(474821, 45134, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good capture of this.  Good tones.  I expected a few of these for this challenge!</td>', 'Good capture of this.  Good tones.  I expected a few of these for this challenge!', '2003-11-05 23:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(474822, 44888, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, pretty well done.  I find the bright overexposed area a little blinding!</td>', 'Nice idea, pretty well done.  I find the bright overexposed area a little blinding!', '2003-11-05 23:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(474823, 45096, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones</td>', 'Very nice tones', '2003-11-05 23:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(474825, 44990, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.  One suggestion for this one, though I know this exposure was difficult, would be to get more light on the rocks themselves, so I can see how smooth and their pretty sufaces.</td>', 'Nice effect.  One suggestion for this one, though I know this exposure was difficult, would be to get more light on the rocks themselves, so I can see how smooth and their pretty sufaces.', '2003-11-06 00:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(474828, 45172, 12253, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, but I can''t see the spiral here.  I can''t tell what this is either, or see much of a pattern.</td>', 'Pretty colors, but I can''t see the spiral here.  I can''t tell what this is either, or see much of a pattern.', '2003-11-06 00:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(474829, 44900, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good, clever idea.  As a photo it loses something in the screen shot, including depth.  Maybe the use of more color would have helped this?</td>', 'Good, clever idea.  As a photo it loses something in the screen shot, including depth.  Maybe the use of more color would have helped this?', '2003-11-06 00:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(474830, 45127, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but perhaps this one is too short!  Actually the reflection of the spiral--a barber''s pole effect, might have been better.  Now why didn''t I think of that before!</td>', 'Nice idea but perhaps this one is too short!  Actually the reflection of the spiral--a barber''s pole effect, might have been better.  Now why didn''t I think of that before!', '2003-11-06 00:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(474831, 45106, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting, especially if it is from a microscope; but it kind of looks like a vegetable! LOL.  Probably doesn''t apply if in a microscope, but from the point of pure aesthetics, might have been nice to have the light softer at the top part (perhaps slightly overexposed?)</td>', 'Interesting, especially if it is from a microscope; but it kind of looks like a vegetable! LOL.  Probably doesn''t apply if in a microscope, but from the point of pure aesthetics, might have been nice to have the light softer at the top part (perhaps slightly overexposed?)', '2003-11-06 00:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(474834, 44947, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot; not sure it says infinite to me though...</td>', 'I like this shot a lot; not sure it says infinite to me though...', '2003-11-06 00:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(474838, 44631, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea; it gives me the idea of an image of the sky, looking down the perspective of a telescope; next time!  This would have worked better with at least a sillouete of a telescope and without the fence.</td>', 'Nice idea; it gives me the idea of an image of the sky, looking down the perspective of a telescope; next time!  This would have worked better with at least a sillouete of a telescope and without the fence.', '2003-11-06 00:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(475029, 45176, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are wow. And the shapes of yellow add a lot of punch to the composition.  Good abstract.</td>', 'The colors are wow. And the shapes of yellow add a lot of punch to the composition.  Good abstract.', '2003-11-06 06:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(475032, 45162, 11800, '<td valign="top">The composition is very good, and original. The colors are very muted and for this photo perfect. he overuse of neat image has removed most of the fine details, which I would have like to see.</td>', 'The composition is very good, and original. The colors are very muted and for this photo perfect. he overuse of neat image has removed most of the fine details, which I would have like to see.', '2003-11-06 07:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(475033, 45075, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors were well chosen. I find the crop too tight. You used a technique I have tried and not had a lot of success with yet, so I admire that.</td>', 'The colors were well chosen. I find the crop too tight. You used a technique I have tried and not had a lot of success with yet, so I admire that.', '2003-11-06 07:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(475034, 44659, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the subject. Art might be forever but it looks like nature is overtaking it. The colors are pleasing. Simple subject but easy to look at.</td>', 'Nice framing of the subject. Art might be forever but it looks like nature is overtaking it. The colors are pleasing. Simple subject but easy to look at.', '2003-11-06 07:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(475036, 45177, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I can''t decide if I like the movement or not. I want to see some of the subject in sharp focus, yet I like the effect of the slower shutter speed. Pleasing photograph overall.</td>', 'This is nice. I can''t decide if I like the movement or not. I want to see some of the subject in sharp focus, yet I like the effect of the slower shutter speed. Pleasing photograph overall.', '2003-11-06 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(475037, 45087, 11800, '<td valign="top">The title isn''t correct. There are lots of weeds on these steps. Other than that you did a nice job framing your subject.  The upper right side adds some interest to what could have been a boring scene.</td>', 'The title isn''t correct. There are lots of weeds on these steps. Other than that you did a nice job framing your subject.  The upper right side adds some interest to what could have been a boring scene.', '2003-11-06 07:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(475039, 44999, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is really good. Like the use of the lighting to suggest night and day. The composition is effective and the focus is perfect.</td>', 'This is really good. Like the use of the lighting to suggest night and day. The composition is effective and the focus is perfect.', '2003-11-06 07:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(475050, 44888, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. I would like to see it with more of a dynamic range.  Good composition, prospective and dof.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. I would like to see it with more of a dynamic range.  Good composition, prospective and dof.', '2003-11-06 07:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(475058, 45125, 11800, '<td valign="top">Like the composition. and the point of view angle.<br/>There is so much grain, I can''t help but think you added it. The problem with adding grain is you take a hit in sharpness. With this picture, it''s a toss up. I think I would have liked to see it sharp. You might consider volunteering it to the post processing thread. It would be interesting to see different treatments.</td>', 'Like the composition. and the point of view angle.There is so much grain, I can''t help but think you added it. The problem with adding grain is you take a hit in sharpness. With this picture, it''s a toss up. I think I would have liked to see it sharp. You might consider volunteering it to the post processing thread. It would be interesting to see different treatments.', '2003-11-06 07:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(475062, 45130, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, it''s a pretty picture though. It doesn''t convey the feeling of infinity. I think it''s because I can see the land on the other side and the title is telling me to look at the water. Hope you can understand what I''m trying to say.</td>', 'I don''t get the title, it''s a pretty picture though. It doesn''t convey the feeling of infinity. I think it''s because I can see the land on the other side and the title is telling me to look at the water. Hope you can understand what I''m trying to say.', '2003-11-06 07:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(475068, 45036, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Really creative! At first I thought you did this with a computer, then I saw where they overlap. This would have been a fine contender if it was cleaned up a bit. The hole is really jaggy and the edges of the picture are really noisy.  Did you try getting the hole more round?</td>', 'Cool idea. Really creative! At first I thought you did this with a computer, then I saw where they overlap. This would have been a fine contender if it was cleaned up a bit. The hole is really jaggy and the edges of the picture are really noisy.  Did you try getting the hole more round?', '2003-11-06 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(475080, 45104, 11800, '<td valign="top">This a beautiful. The tonal range is outstanding. To me, the heart of the image is the icy handrails and rocks so I might have liked to see them larger within the frame. The darkness of the area around the cabin is a distraction. It''s really too bad the corner of the handrail got clipped out. Sorry to sound so negative. I do really like this and keep thinking how wonderful this would look full size, hanging in a gallery.</td>', 'This a beautiful. The tonal range is outstanding. To me, the heart of the image is the icy handrails and rocks so I might have liked to see them larger within the frame. The darkness of the area around the cabin is a distraction. It''s really too bad the corner of the handrail got clipped out. Sorry to sound so negative. I do really like this and keep thinking how wonderful this would look full size, hanging in a gallery.', '2003-11-06 08:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(475085, 44994, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  The crop is effective. The title is too long.</td>', 'Good capture.  The crop is effective. The title is too long.', '2003-11-06 08:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(475091, 44899, 11800, '<td valign="top">It is like some of his paintings! To me there are just too many squares for this to be an effective art image. The area on the right has shapes that transition nicely to fish. You might consider getting closer using the same angle and isolating them. This would make a good background stock image.</td>', 'It is like some of his paintings! To me there are just too many squares for this to be an effective art image. The area on the right has shapes that transition nicely to fish. You might consider getting closer using the same angle and isolating them. This would make a good background stock image.', '2003-11-06 08:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(475136, 45049, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think I know what you were going for, impressionistic abstract,  and the attempt is OK. The dof works well. I would love to have seen at least one thing in focus. The colors look hazy. Maybe pumping up the saturation would give it more punch.  This is a pleasing picture to look at though.</td>', 'I think I know what you were going for, impressionistic abstract,  and the attempt is OK. The dof works well. I would love to have seen at least one thing in focus. The colors look hazy. Maybe pumping up the saturation would give it more punch.  This is a pleasing picture to look at though.', '2003-11-06 09:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(475144, 44963, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good control of lighting and dof. The focus seems to be sharpest on the 5th pill. I don''t know, but I might have tried to focus on the 1st one.</td>', 'Good control of lighting and dof. The focus seems to be sharpest on the 5th pill. I don''t know, but I might have tried to focus on the 1st one.', '2003-11-06 09:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(475150, 45138, 11800, '<td valign="top">There are so many beautiful abstracts in this challenge, it''s hard to pick a favorite. This is one of my favorites so far. Wonderful control of all the important techniques. The choice of color is perfect. It soothes instead of distracts so the viewer can enjoy  the shape and texture of the composition. Nit, the soft focus on the left side, but not a fatal flaw.</td>', 'There are so many beautiful abstracts in this challenge, it''s hard to pick a favorite. This is one of my favorites so far. Wonderful control of all the important techniques. The choice of color is perfect. It soothes instead of distracts so the viewer can enjoy  the shape and texture of the composition. Nit, the soft focus on the left side, but not a fatal flaw.', '2003-11-06 09:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(475160, 45173, 11800, '<td valign="top">Just enough information to hold my attention, yet not enough to really identify the thing being photographed makes for a good abstract. I like the grain, too.</td>', 'Just enough information to hold my attention, yet not enough to really identify the thing being photographed makes for a good abstract. I like the grain, too.', '2003-11-06 09:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(475176, 44925, 11800, '<td valign="top">The shadow is very interesting and, to me, has the potential to define infinity more than the fence itself. The post on the left creates a big area of darkness that distracts from the composition and takes up a lot a space. Even though the composition isn''t centered, it has a feeling of being too centered and that is most likely because of the dark area and because the shadow forms an almost straight line thru the composition.</td>', 'The shadow is very interesting and, to me, has the potential to define infinity more than the fence itself. The post on the left creates a big area of darkness that distracts from the composition and takes up a lot a space. Even though the composition isn''t centered, it has a feeling of being too centered and that is most likely because of the dark area and because the shadow forms an almost straight line thru the composition.', '2003-11-06 10:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(475191, 44974, 11800, '<td valign="top">Your title confuses me. Death happens to everyone, sooner or later, in war and in peace.  So what are you really trying to say?</td>', 'Your title confuses me. Death happens to everyone, sooner or later, in war and in peace.  So what are you really trying to say?', '2003-11-06 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(475195, 44522, 9146, '<td valign="top">Amazing =10</td>', 'Amazing =10', '2003-11-06 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(475196, 45101, 9146, '<td valign="top">it''s the bird in the sky that got me =10</td>', 'it''s the bird in the sky that got me =10', '2003-11-06 10:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(475198, 45104, 9146, '<td valign="top">ATABOY!!!!!! =10</td>', 'ATABOY!!!!!! =10', '2003-11-06 10:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(475202, 44629, 9146, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how this is leagle but if it is it deserves a 10</td>', 'I don''t know how this is leagle but if it is it deserves a 10', '2003-11-06 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(475206, 44990, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this image. And you have very good control of your exposure. However, I think for this challenge, it would have been more effective if you had used a faster shutter speed. The water looks too misty to be able to smooth the rocks. If the water were more visible, one would be able to equate it''s movement to it''s effect on the rocks.</td>', 'I like this image. And you have very good control of your exposure. However, I think for this challenge, it would have been more effective if you had used a faster shutter speed. The water looks too misty to be able to smooth the rocks. If the water were more visible, one would be able to equate it''s movement to it''s effect on the rocks.', '2003-11-06 10:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(475210, 45010, 11800, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition of a common interpretation. Outstanding.</td>', 'Excellent composition of a common interpretation. Outstanding.', '2003-11-06 10:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(475231, 45019, 11800, '<td valign="top">Creative. I think the pins would have added more intrest if they had been placed more precisly so one could only see the red dot.</td>', 'Creative. I think the pins would have added more intrest if they had been placed more precisly so one could only see the red dot.', '2003-11-06 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(475259, 44587, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the high key approach you took. The missing information is equally as important as the provided information in answering your question.  Nit, more contrast to bring out how well focused the shot is.</td>', 'I like the high key approach you took. The missing information is equally as important as the provided information in answering your question.  Nit, more contrast to bring out how well focused the shot is.', '2003-11-06 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(475274, 44582, 11800, '<td valign="top">Well set up. All the props work well together to make this seem like a casual photo, yet I think it took you a long time to get everything right. Good stock photo. That''s a complement!</td>', 'Well set up. All the props work well together to make this seem like a casual photo, yet I think it took you a long time to get everything right. Good stock photo. That''s a complement!', '2003-11-06 11:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(475301, 45012, 11800, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of the most beautiful images I''ve seen. Colors, motion, focus, subject, composition...all perfect. Good job.  I hope you put some information on the entry form.</td>', 'This has to be one of the most beautiful images I''ve seen. Colors, motion, focus, subject, composition...all perfect. Good job.  I hope you put some information on the entry form.', '2003-11-06 11:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(475360, 44629, 11800, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a good imagination.</td>', 'You''ve got a good imagination.', '2003-11-06 11:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(475363, 45101, 11800, '<td valign="top">Really stunning photo.</td>', 'Really stunning photo.', '2003-11-06 11:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(475383, 44484, 11800, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure control. Now the bad news. It lacks interest.  I really do admire how perfect the lighting and dof is.</td>', 'Perfect exposure control. Now the bad news. It lacks interest.  I really do admire how perfect the lighting and dof is.', '2003-11-06 11:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(475389, 44904, 11800, '<td valign="top">That must be an awesome sight to see. I didn''t realize there were that many of them uncovered.  Are these reproductions or the real ones? Looks like there are repeats, so they must be reproductions.</td>', 'That must be an awesome sight to see. I didn''t realize there were that many of them uncovered.  Are these reproductions or the real ones? Looks like there are repeats, so they must be reproductions.', '2003-11-06 11:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(475405, 45155, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast treatment. Everything is suitabally sharp, pov is right on. The seats form a nice pleasing sweep. Good job.</td>', 'I like the high contrast treatment. Everything is suitabally sharp, pov is right on. The seats form a nice pleasing sweep. Good job.', '2003-11-06 12:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(475407, 44897, 13909, '<td valign="top">excellent perspective</td>', 'excellent perspective', '2003-11-06 12:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(475644, 45133, 11843, '<td valign="top">This might have received a higher score from me if maybe you had shown more of the yellow lines out into the distance. Focus is off a bit.</td>', 'This might have received a higher score from me if maybe you had shown more of the yellow lines out into the distance. Focus is off a bit.', '2003-11-06 16:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(475649, 44961, 11843, '<td valign="top">Where''s Mom? Your title implies that this boys mother has seemingly infinite conversations. That correlation would have worked better if you had somehow incorporated her having a conversation into the photo.</td>', 'Where''s Mom? Your title implies that this boys mother has seemingly infinite conversations. That correlation would have worked better if you had somehow incorporated her having a conversation into the photo.', '2003-11-06 16:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(475652, 45177, 11843, '<td valign="top">Not enough of the grain showing to make me think infinite, but good idea. Nice texture from the grain.  A bit out of focus.</td>', 'Not enough of the grain showing to make me think infinite, but good idea. Nice texture from the grain.  A bit out of focus.', '2003-11-06 16:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(475655, 44925, 11843, '<td valign="top">Not enough fence to give me the feeling of Infinite, but good Idea.</td>', 'Not enough fence to give me the feeling of Infinite, but good Idea.', '2003-11-06 16:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(475656, 45169, 11843, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm. A bit more DOF and a longer piece of paper to spread this inifinity symbol out would have helped. Good idea, although not very unique.</td>', 'Hmmmm. A bit more DOF and a longer piece of paper to spread this inifinity symbol out would have helped. Good idea, although not very unique.', '2003-11-06 16:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(475659, 44899, 11843, '<td valign="top">I almost get a sense of depth near the flourescent bulb, but not quite. Doesn''t give me that Infinite feeling. Nice focus</td>', 'I almost get a sense of depth near the flourescent bulb, but not quite. Doesn''t give me that Infinite feeling. Nice focus', '2003-11-06 16:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(475662, 44957, 11843, '<td valign="top">Very cool, is this a fossil? Not getting that infinite feeling with this. Good focus. Maybe a darker background to show more contrast around the edges of the shell.</td>', 'Very cool, is this a fossil? Not getting that infinite feeling with this. Good focus. Maybe a darker background to show more contrast around the edges of the shell.', '2003-11-06 16:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(475669, 45125, 11843, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the grainyness is on purpose, but I think it is over done a little. Can''t get a very good sense of perspective or a feeling of infinite. I like the angle or tilt a lot! And maybe crop out the bottom up to the point where the top of the track has the lighter shade. Great idea.</td>', 'Not sure if the grainyness is on purpose, but I think it is over done a little. Can''t get a very good sense of perspective or a feeling of infinite. I like the angle or tilt a lot! And maybe crop out the bottom up to the point where the top of the track has the lighter shade. Great idea.', '2003-11-06 16:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(475673, 44958, 11843, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I''m not getting that Infinite feeling from this angle. Depth of field needs adjustment.</td>', 'Good idea, but I''m not getting that Infinite feeling from this angle. Depth of field needs adjustment.', '2003-11-06 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(475686, 45129, 11843, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I like it a lot, but need to change title. IMO - A needle implies just one needle or flower. A haystack implies just one haystak to your infinite amount of leaves. Also, focus is off a bit.</td>', 'Good idea, I like it a lot, but need to change title. IMO - A needle implies just one needle or flower. A haystack implies just one haystak to your infinite amount of leaves. Also, focus is off a bit.', '2003-11-06 16:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(475693, 45176, 11843, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, I just don''t get that seemingly infinite feeling. Great abstract! Good focus</td>', 'Hmmmm, I just don''t get that seemingly infinite feeling. Great abstract! Good focus', '2003-11-06 16:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(475697, 45161, 11843, '<td valign="top">Too dark in some areas, too much light in others. Polarizing lens would help here.</td>', 'Too dark in some areas, too much light in others. Polarizing lens would help here.', '2003-11-06 16:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(475701, 45172, 11843, '<td valign="top">Not getting that Seemingly Infinite feeling. Maybe if you had shown a little more in the distance. Can''t really make out what this object is. Depth of field needs work. Great colors and contrast.</td>', 'Not getting that Seemingly Infinite feeling. Maybe if you had shown a little more in the distance. Can''t really make out what this object is. Depth of field needs work. Great colors and contrast.', '2003-11-06 16:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(475720, 44724, 11843, '<td valign="top">IMO - the point of all this is to create a photo that portrays the feeling of Seemingly Infinite to everyone else, not just to yourself. Its a nice abstract, but I guess I don''t get the infinite part.</td>', 'IMO - the point of all this is to create a photo that portrays the feeling of Seemingly Infinite to everyone else, not just to yourself. Its a nice abstract, but I guess I don''t get the infinite part.', '2003-11-06 17:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
