(477508, 44921, 11923, '<td valign="top">Mmmm what a great idea!  I like the lighting and composition of the image - the subject matter is excellent and the title is good.  I think this would make a great advertisement photo.  Nicely done.  8</td>', 'Mmmm what a great idea!  I like the lighting and composition of the image - the subject matter is excellent and the title is good.  I think this would make a great advertisement photo.  Nicely done.  8', '2003-11-08 16:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(477510, 45143, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great feeling of distances, really plays up the infinite aspect.   Focus is good, but I wish there was just a bit more sharpness to  the photo, a little more punch.  Composition is good, I would suggest cropping a bit more off the top so that white truck wasn''t visible.  Overall a very nice photo. 6</td>', 'Great feeling of distances, really plays up the infinite aspect.   Focus is good, but I wish there was just a bit more sharpness to  the photo, a little more punch.  Composition is good, I would suggest cropping a bit more off the top so that white truck wasn''t visible.  Overall a very nice photo. 6', '2003-11-08 16:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(477511, 44984, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, the mist or haze mutes the colors a little too much for me in this photo, but I do like the contrast of the grey (ice-covered?) trees and the crisp green grass of the fairway.  I don''t really get an infinite feel from the image, but I think its nice over all.  Would like a little more sharpness to it as well.  6</td>', 'An interesting image, the mist or haze mutes the colors a little too much for me in this photo, but I do like the contrast of the grey (ice-covered?) trees and the crisp green grass of the fairway.  I don''t really get an infinite feel from the image, but I think its nice over all.  Would like a little more sharpness to it as well.  6', '2003-11-08 16:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(477514, 45138, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great title, very interesting image - high impact quality for me.  To be honest I don''t think infinite when I look at the image, other aspects of it play precedence but I am able to see the connection.  I think the focus is great, like the composition and lighting - I do wish the light played a bit more on the droplets on the left like it does on the right - gives it an extra bit of zing.  Nice colors, well done.  7</td>', 'Great title, very interesting image - high impact quality for me.  To be honest I don''t think infinite when I look at the image, other aspects of it play precedence but I am able to see the connection.  I think the focus is great, like the composition and lighting - I do wish the light played a bit more on the droplets on the left like it does on the right - gives it an extra bit of zing.  Nice colors, well done.  7', '2003-11-08 16:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(477515, 45129, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice fall image, I like the bright spots of color from the yellow and still green leaves.  Lighting is good, as is focus.  I''m not getting a huge infinite feeling from the image, though I do see the connection - I think if it were cropped a bit more on the top that feeling would be stronger - towards the top it looks as if the leaves are thinning out.  Very nice photo.  6</td>', 'Nice fall image, I like the bright spots of color from the yellow and still green leaves.  Lighting is good, as is focus.  I''m not getting a huge infinite feeling from the image, though I do see the connection - I think if it were cropped a bit more on the top that feeling would be stronger - towards the top it looks as if the leaves are thinning out.  Very nice photo.  6', '2003-11-08 16:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(477517, 45075, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice mirror work!  The colors are very striking, composition is good too.  That ruched bit of cloth (napkin?) really gives a nice kick to the photo.   I''d be interested in seeing this with all of the elements in their entirety too instead of cropped off.  Fits the theme very well.  I think a big stronger focus would lend a nice crispness to the image.  7</td>', 'Nice mirror work!  The colors are very striking, composition is good too.  That ruched bit of cloth (napkin?) really gives a nice kick to the photo.   I''d be interested in seeing this with all of the elements in their entirety too instead of cropped off.  Fits the theme very well.  I think a big stronger focus would lend a nice crispness to the image.  7', '2003-11-08 16:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(477518, 45049, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice image!  I like the blurred look - seems very watercolor-like.  Great interpretation of the challenge, the colors and lighting is excellent.  I do wish that the stalks at the forefront had a bit more focus/sharpness to them.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Very nice image!  I like the blurred look - seems very watercolor-like.  Great interpretation of the challenge, the colors and lighting is excellent.  I do wish that the stalks at the forefront had a bit more focus/sharpness to them.  Well done.  7', '2003-11-08 16:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(477520, 44574, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image.  I like the use of black and white and selective use of light.  Gives the photo some nice shadowplay and adds to the interest.  Besides the title though, I don''t really see a connection to infinite - though I can understand the concept behind the photo/title.. I''m not sure it comes through strong enough or has enough context in the actual photo.  5</td>', 'This is a very nice image.  I like the use of black and white and selective use of light.  Gives the photo some nice shadowplay and adds to the interest.  Besides the title though, I don''t really see a connection to infinite - though I can understand the concept behind the photo/title.. I''m not sure it comes through strong enough or has enough context in the actual photo.  5', '2003-11-08 16:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(477521, 44904, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.  Fits the challenge perfectly, high interest impact, I love the subject.  Lighting, composition and focus are great.  I would love to see this in person - saw a special on tv about them.  Very well shot.  10</td>', 'Fantastic image.  Fits the challenge perfectly, high interest impact, I love the subject.  Lighting, composition and focus are great.  I would love to see this in person - saw a special on tv about them.  Very well shot.  10', '2003-11-08 16:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(477522, 44999, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I love the composition, the placement of both the time pieces &amp; the sand is excellent.  I like the warm tone of the lighting as well.  Great use of space and the focus is very nice.  You should be very pleased with the results, I would be!  10</td>', 'Great image!  I love the composition, the placement of both the time pieces & the sand is excellent.  I like the warm tone of the lighting as well.  Great use of space and the focus is very nice.  You should be very pleased with the results, I would be!  10', '2003-11-08 16:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(477523, 44649, 11923, '<td valign="top">Definitely fits the challenge, looks very science fiction-y.  I like the contrast between crisp curving lines and then the blurred black hole.  Is this a spring?  Or maybe one of those wire whisks?  Lighting is great.  Well done!  8</td>', 'Definitely fits the challenge, looks very science fiction-y.  I like the contrast between crisp curving lines and then the blurred black hole.  Is this a spring?  Or maybe one of those wire whisks?  Lighting is great.  Well done!  8', '2003-11-08 16:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
