(478060, 44631, 2883, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting. The chain link fence is distracting. It might be slightly oversharpened, creating a slight halo around the siloette.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting. The chain link fence is distracting. It might be slightly oversharpened, creating a slight halo around the siloette.', '2003-11-09 17:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(478061, 44882, 2883, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the raking of all those leaves can seem like an infinite job at times. Nice use of depth of field, though I think I''d set it so the focus would fall off sooner in the picture.</td>', 'I''m sure the raking of all those leaves can seem like an infinite job at times. Nice use of depth of field, though I think I''d set it so the focus would fall off sooner in the picture.', '2003-11-09 17:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
