(478090, 44921, 12578, '<td valign="top">Awesome yet so simple a thought really ! This is the type of shot I prefer to staged pens - papaers books etc, it is simple yet so meaningful to the challenge and you have captured it beautifully - the image on teh whole does appear very very sharp in the center tho and very reflective which I would have prefered toning down just a tad ( could be my new TFT monitor tho as its very bright compared to what I am used to ) Excellent job - 9</td>', 'Awesome yet so simple a thought really ! This is the type of shot I prefer to staged pens - papaers books etc, it is simple yet so meaningful to the challenge and you have captured it beautifully - the image on teh whole does appear very very sharp in the center tho and very reflective which I would have prefered toning down just a tad ( could be my new TFT monitor tho as its very bright compared to what I am used to ) Excellent job - 9', '2003-11-09 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(478093, 44484, 12578, '<td valign="top">Good image and very crisp shades but would have loved to see a little something more in the shot personally as it almost looks more like computer graphics than a photo.</td>', 'Good image and very crisp shades but would have loved to see a little something more in the shot personally as it almost looks more like computer graphics than a photo.', '2003-11-09 18:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(478098, 45129, 12578, '<td valign="top">I think the full large shot would do this alot more justice than the shrunk down version you had to submit ( it seems more fitting for the all alone challnge though ) - I think it could be a little punchier by bringing the levels up a little bit more too. Good shot none the less :0)</td>', 'I think the full large shot would do this alot more justice than the shrunk down version you had to submit ( it seems more fitting for the all alone challnge though ) - I think it could be a little punchier by bringing the levels up a little bit more too. Good shot none the less :0)', '2003-11-09 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(478101, 45097, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great colour in the image but I hate to see a good image as thus destroyed by the artist trying to describe to the viewer what the subject matter is in the title - you seem to be telling us that as this is a infinate challenge that you think this is not a clear day ? In my view it is and had I not been told "On a clear day you can see foever" I would have given a couple of notches higher a score than I will now - Again though this is a great image, I just dont see the point telling us what it should represent. Awsome Blues in this shot too.</td>', 'Great colour in the image but I hate to see a good image as thus destroyed by the artist trying to describe to the viewer what the subject matter is in the title - you seem to be telling us that as this is a infinate challenge that you think this is not a clear day ? In my view it is and had I not been told "On a clear day you can see foever" I would have given a couple of notches higher a score than I will now - Again though this is a great image, I just dont see the point telling us what it should represent. Awsome Blues in this shot too.', '2003-11-09 18:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(478102, 45088, 12578, '<td valign="top">shame about the power cables but even still this is one of the better shots in the challenge to my standards. Represents well and truly INFINITY ! Well done - 9</td>', 'shame about the power cables but even still this is one of the better shots in the challenge to my standards. Represents well and truly INFINITY ! Well done - 9', '2003-11-09 18:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(478104, 44900, 12578, '<td valign="top">I thought of doing the exact same Idea ! Just wasnt sure how to go about it for the results I wanted... You seem to have pulle dit off quite well although you should have put your monitor lelvel in the shot tho</td>', 'I thought of doing the exact same Idea ! Just wasnt sure how to go about it for the results I wanted... You seem to have pulle dit off quite well although you should have put your monitor lelvel in the shot tho', '2003-11-09 18:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(478126, 45036, 6532, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color!  The hole also adds an interesting dimension.  My top pick for this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful color!  The hole also adds an interesting dimension.  My top pick for this challenge.', '2003-11-09 19:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(478129, 44537, 6532, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea.  Definitely an image of infinity.  Good job!  Seems just a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Wonderful idea.  Definitely an image of infinity.  Good job!  Seems just a bit out of focus.', '2003-11-09 19:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(478132, 45134, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice image complimented by the telephone poles running parallel to the tracks.  The sepia also works for this image.  Overall image seems to be just a tad crooked.  Good job. 8</td>', 'Nice image complimented by the telephone poles running parallel to the tracks.  The sepia also works for this image.  Overall image seems to be just a tad crooked.  Good job. 8', '2003-11-09 19:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(478157, 45134, 11769, '<td valign="top">WOW what a feeling of DOF! I like. 10</td>', 'WOW what a feeling of DOF! I like. 10', '2003-11-09 20:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(478189, 44602, 14014, '<td valign="top">love the shot. i''m a rookie photographer...how do you get those like white backgrounds with nice shadows and all???</td>', 'love the shot. i''m a rookie photographer...how do you get those like white backgrounds with nice shadows and all???', '2003-11-09 21:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(478203, 44968, 11034, '<td valign="top">I dont remember the maths, but this reflections are finite. Still a very good shoot. I give them a 7.</td>', 'I dont remember the maths, but this reflections are finite. Still a very good shoot. I give them a 7.', '2003-11-09 21:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(478216, 45102, 11034, '<td valign="top">The spot is too centered, but still a interisting shoot. 6</td>', 'The spot is too centered, but still a interisting shoot. 6', '2003-11-09 21:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(478229, 44619, 6870, '<td valign="top">Astounding clarity! Really nice colors and composition. It does indeed communicate infinity to me. 10</td>', 'Astounding clarity! Really nice colors and composition. It does indeed communicate infinity to me. 10', '2003-11-09 21:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(478231, 44574, 6870, '<td valign="top">This photo may have some flaws, but the emotional impact is so powerful I feel they overwhelm any problems with it. 9</td>', 'This photo may have some flaws, but the emotional impact is so powerful I feel they overwhelm any problems with it. 9', '2003-11-09 21:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(478234, 45104, 6870, '<td valign="top">The tones here are so clear and moody, and there is such a diverse range of them, it makes for an amazing shot. 9</td>', 'The tones here are so clear and moody, and there is such a diverse range of them, it makes for an amazing shot. 9', '2003-11-09 21:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(478236, 44990, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very clever and original idea. Long exposure is sure pretty and indicates the infinityof time. 9</td>', 'Very clever and original idea. Long exposure is sure pretty and indicates the infinityof time. 9', '2003-11-09 21:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(478238, 45101, 6870, '<td valign="top">The gothic spires here are such a wonderful foreground for the dramatic clouds! And there are so many of them! I feel that infinity is communicated--or at least alluded to--here. 9</td>', 'The gothic spires here are such a wonderful foreground for the dramatic clouds! And there are so many of them! I feel that infinity is communicated--or at least alluded to--here. 9', '2003-11-09 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(478240, 45066, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really brilliant use of light and depth of field here, Contrasts are very nice, too. 9</td>', 'Really brilliant use of light and depth of field here, Contrasts are very nice, too. 9', '2003-11-09 21:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(478243, 45049, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very moody and intriguing image. I like the focus you''ve used (and hope you didn''t use layers to add a moody blur). Just marvelous composition and colors. 9</td>', 'Very moody and intriguing image. I like the focus you''ve used (and hope you didn''t use layers to add a moody blur). Just marvelous composition and colors. 9', '2003-11-09 21:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(478245, 45125, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very fine point of view here and nice use of B/W and contrasts. I like the noise here, though you may have gone just a lilttle bit overboard. Still, nice work.</td>', 'Very fine point of view here and nice use of B/W and contrasts. I like the noise here, though you may have gone just a lilttle bit overboard. Still, nice work.', '2003-11-09 21:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(478247, 45019, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea! I like how the onion rings get smaller and smaller, hinting at infinity. You might try experimenting more so we can''t see the pins--perhaps just put the onions on a horizonal surface? Nice work.</td>', 'Clever idea! I like how the onion rings get smaller and smaller, hinting at infinity. You might try experimenting more so we can''t see the pins--perhaps just put the onions on a horizonal surface? Nice work.', '2003-11-09 21:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(478253, 45006, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very symbolic communication of infinity. The idea of lines converging is a good one. Perhaps if the angle weren''t so wide, it would be more convincing.</td>', 'Very symbolic communication of infinity. The idea of lines converging is a good one. Perhaps if the angle weren''t so wide, it would be more convincing.', '2003-11-09 21:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(478256, 45113, 6870, '<td valign="top">The image contradicts your title, in a way, for you show here, with the white cross especially, that death is not infinite. Rather, it continues on as a new kind of life. I like the point of view here, and the white cross grabs my attention quickly!</td>', 'The image contradicts your title, in a way, for you show here, with the white cross especially, that death is not infinite. Rather, it continues on as a new kind of life. I like the point of view here, and the white cross grabs my attention quickly!', '2003-11-09 21:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(478258, 45090, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The grainy redness actually works for me in adding an artistic, painterly element to this image. I''m not sure it communicates infinity exactly, but I''ll trust you!</td>', 'Interesting idea. The grainy redness actually works for me in adding an artistic, painterly element to this image. I''m not sure it communicates infinity exactly, but I''ll trust you!', '2003-11-09 21:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(478292, 45125, 12448, '<td valign="top">The grain and noise on this shot is very distracting, the angle works well, taking you through the shot but the quality really hurts it.  a 3</td>', 'The grain and noise on this shot is very distracting, the angle works well, taking you through the shot but the quality really hurts it.  a 3', '2003-11-09 22:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(478294, 45106, 12448, '<td valign="top">What is this a shot of?  I can''t wait to find out, LOL!  Anyway, the idea is there in that molecules are infinte and never ending but this really doesn''t gel with that idea for me.  The lighting is blown out towards the top to me and the curve of the item is a bit of a distraction to me overall.  a 4</td>', 'What is this a shot of?  I can''t wait to find out, LOL!  Anyway, the idea is there in that molecules are infinte and never ending but this really doesn''t gel with that idea for me.  The lighting is blown out towards the top to me and the curve of the item is a bit of a distraction to me overall.  a 4', '2003-11-09 22:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(478295, 45126, 12448, '<td valign="top">Having something to do around the house is a neverending story, no doubt but the shot is wanting to me overall.  The contrast just just off and the cropping bothers me just a bit for some reason, can''t quite explain it.  A 4</td>', 'Having something to do around the house is a neverending story, no doubt but the shot is wanting to me overall.  The contrast just just off and the cropping bothers me just a bit for some reason, can''t quite explain it.  A 4', '2003-11-09 22:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(478297, 45090, 12448, '<td valign="top">The grain and noise in this shot is very distracting and it really doesn''t remind me of a start being born, more just a head on shot of a red light with a filter of sorts.  A 4</td>', 'The grain and noise in this shot is very distracting and it really doesn''t remind me of a start being born, more just a head on shot of a red light with a filter of sorts.  A 4', '2003-11-09 22:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(478298, 45133, 12448, '<td valign="top">When you are driving that can seem infinte, can''t it!  The idea is well done but the shot left me wanting.  I see a beginning, I see an end and the color seems a bit dull to me.  A 4</td>', 'When you are driving that can seem infinte, can''t it!  The idea is well done but the shot left me wanting.  I see a beginning, I see an end and the color seems a bit dull to me.  A 4', '2003-11-09 22:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(478302, 45049, 12448, '<td valign="top">The dream like quality on this shot leaves me wanting more clarity.  I know when you are in the middle of a cornfield it seems endless but shooting on the outside shows me an ending.  The cropping or setting of this shot was well done overall, drawing you in on the left and taking you out on the right.  A 4</td>', 'The dream like quality on this shot leaves me wanting more clarity.  I know when you are in the middle of a cornfield it seems endless but shooting on the outside shows me an ending.  The cropping or setting of this shot was well done overall, drawing you in on the left and taking you out on the right.  A 4', '2003-11-09 22:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(478303, 45161, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very pretty indeed but a bit blurry and the colors really don''t pop at me.  A 4</td>', 'Very pretty indeed but a bit blurry and the colors really don''t pop at me.  A 4', '2003-11-09 22:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(478305, 44587, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not very long with that tiny little ball!  The white on white is okay on this shot, a bit blown out on the right, perhaps if you had string coming in from one side and leading out the other with the ball in the middle, filling the middle of the screen it would convey the message more?  A 4</td>', 'Not very long with that tiny little ball!  The white on white is okay on this shot, a bit blown out on the right, perhaps if you had string coming in from one side and leading out the other with the ball in the middle, filling the middle of the screen it would convey the message more?  A 4', '2003-11-09 23:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(478307, 44961, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard that from my kids before!  A nice idea but doesn''t really convey the challenge idea overall adn the lighting is a bit bright on this shot, perhaps if the boy looked more bored or ready to fall asleep while waiting?  A 4</td>', 'I''ve heard that from my kids before!  A nice idea but doesn''t really convey the challenge idea overall adn the lighting is a bit bright on this shot, perhaps if the boy looked more bored or ready to fall asleep while waiting?  A 4', '2003-11-09 23:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(478310, 45006, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yea, that is what they taught us in Art 101.  I see two lines drawn on a peice of paper, the black line across the top is very distracting, perhaps a tighter crop?  And the blue light really hurts this shot to me.  A 4</td>', 'Yea, that is what they taught us in Art 101.  I see two lines drawn on a peice of paper, the black line across the top is very distracting, perhaps a tighter crop?  And the blue light really hurts this shot to me.  A 4', '2003-11-09 23:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(478311, 44957, 12448, '<td valign="top">Some spirals do seem to go on forever but not this one, I see the beginning, I see the end.  The lighting on this shot is a bit dark and a little too blue for my taste and the blurred edge really is distracting.  A 4</td>', 'Some spirals do seem to go on forever but not this one, I see the beginning, I see the end.  The lighting on this shot is a bit dark and a little too blue for my taste and the blurred edge really is distracting.  A 4', '2003-11-09 23:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(478328, 44981, 3102, '<td valign="top">Hands down, my favorite of the challenge.  I am looking forward to my next trip to Canada, where the Northern Lights are "infinitely" more common.  This must have been awe inspiring when you saw it!</td>', 'Hands down, my favorite of the challenge.  I am looking forward to my next trip to Canada, where the Northern Lights are "infinitely" more common.  This must have been awe inspiring when you saw it!', '2003-11-09 23:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(478329, 44999, 3102, '<td valign="top">A beautiful presentation!  I like the lighting, too.  I''ll be interested in learning how you accomplished the rippled sand without disturbing it along the way.</td>', 'A beautiful presentation!  I like the lighting, too.  I''ll be interested in learning how you accomplished the rippled sand without disturbing it along the way.', '2003-11-09 23:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(478339, 45134, 9441, '<td valign="top">Wonderful DOF....looks great in the sepia tones...fits this challenge perfectly!  Good job.  I give it a 10</td>', 'Wonderful DOF....looks great in the sepia tones...fits this challenge perfectly!  Good job.  I give it a 10', '2003-11-09 23:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(478341, 44522, 9441, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and tones....wonderful texture and detail in the clouds!</td>', 'beautiful colors and tones....wonderful texture and detail in the clouds!', '2003-11-09 23:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(478344, 44904, 9441, '<td valign="top">this is just too cool!  How''d you achieve this?  Looks great for this challenge....a 10.</td>', 'this is just too cool!  How''d you achieve this?  Looks great for this challenge....a 10.', '2003-11-09 23:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(478348, 44947, 9441, '<td valign="top">terrific colors and lighting...awesome closeup and detail!  I love the lines and curves....nice job.</td>', 'terrific colors and lighting...awesome closeup and detail!  I love the lines and curves....nice job.', '2003-11-09 23:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(478349, 44896, 9441, '<td valign="top">cool shot!  Great feeling of depth and distance...</td>', 'cool shot!  Great feeling of depth and distance...', '2003-11-09 23:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(478351, 45036, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great concept! Too bad the compression artifacts looks like they took a toll on this image (looking at the right lower front and around the "hole" at the end of the tunnel). But don''t get me wrong -- I like it!</td>', 'Great concept! Too bad the compression artifacts looks like they took a toll on this image (looking at the right lower front and around the "hole" at the end of the tunnel). But don''t get me wrong -- I like it!', '2003-11-09 23:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(478355, 45141, 9441, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors...wonderful hues of red...I really like the palm silhouettes!</td>', 'beautiful colors...wonderful hues of red...I really like the palm silhouettes!', '2003-11-09 23:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(478358, 44556, 9441, '<td valign="top">terrific colors and textures in the sky.  Nice silhouettes of the trees.</td>', 'terrific colors and textures in the sky.  Nice silhouettes of the trees.', '2003-11-09 23:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(478361, 45012, 9441, '<td valign="top">awesome photo...what is it?  Very cool.  I love the contrasting colors...so vivid and clear, and the water capture is tremendous!  10</td>', 'awesome photo...what is it?  Very cool.  I love the contrasting colors...so vivid and clear, and the water capture is tremendous!  10', '2003-11-09 23:49:39.000000', NULL, 1);
