(478466, 44484, 2667, '<td valign="top">Wow. I thought this was a most excellent entry and expected it to score much higher. (I scored it a 10)<br/> <br/>I went so far as to piece one together (also using matte paper) but couldn''t get it to curve like I wanted. So I gave up on it before ever taking a shot, and went with a more abstract concept. Glad I did, cause your mobius strip is a lot nicer than mine was!</td>', 'Wow. I thought this was a most excellent entry and expected it to score much higher. (I scored it a 10) I went so far as to piece one together (also using matte paper) but couldn''t get it to curve like I wanted. So I gave up on it before ever taking a shot, and went with a more abstract concept. Glad I did, cause your mobius strip is a lot nicer than mine was!', '2003-11-10 01:12:28.000000', NULL, 0),
