(481084, 44974, 12425, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments.  I took various shots from different POV''s, and this one was the best for the ''Infinite'' theme, in that it appears there are an almost infinite amount of graves.<br/> <br/>In point of fact, the graves you can see here are about all of the graves in the ''war area''.  I couldnt go lower, in that it would show the hedge at the edge, spoiling the effect.  I also wanted to get the best ''pattern'' out of the stones, and whilst they are all lined up in each row, they are not evenly spaced, so this was the best shot to show a ''pattern''.<br/> <br/>I rather liked the blank space to the right - breaks up the shot, so that it''s not just a mess of stones.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-11 21:54:59.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all your comments.  I took various shots from different POV''s, and this one was the best for the ''Infinite'' theme, in that it appears there are an almost infinite amount of graves. In point of fact, the graves you can see here are about all of the graves in the ''war area''.  I couldnt go lower, in that it would show the hedge at the edge, spoiling the effect.  I also wanted to get the best ''pattern'' out of the stones, and whilst they are all lined up in each row, they are not evenly spaced, so this was the best shot to show a ''pattern''. I rather liked the blank space to the right - breaks up the shot, so that it''s not just a mess of stones.', '2003-11-11 21:07:20.000000', '2003-11-11 21:54:59.000000', 0),
(481104, 44974, 1031, '<td valign="top">When I first read the additional info and saw "Brisbane" I thought, "don''t you mean Colma?" Then I noted your actual location in the antipodes (I''ve waited a long tome to use that in a sentence!).<br/> <br/>There is a US National military cemetery in Colma, California which is right next to Brisbane, California. In addition, a search of the Yellow Pages for "cemetery" in Colma will return 29 entries -- hence its informal moniker of "City Of The Dead."</td>', 'When I first read the additional info and saw "Brisbane" I thought, "don''t you mean Colma?" Then I noted your actual location in the antipodes (I''ve waited a long tome to use that in a sentence!). There is a US National military cemetery in Colma, California which is right next to Brisbane, California. In addition, a search of the Yellow Pages for "cemetery" in Colma will return 29 entries -- hence its informal moniker of "City Of The Dead."', '2003-11-11 21:55:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(481557, 44981, 7263, '<td valign="top"><b>super capture!</b></td>', 'super capture!', '2003-11-12 03:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(481753, 44981, 3882, '<td valign="top">Superb Photo!  Congrats on the win and consider yourself graced that you were able to see them.  Here in Ontario we couldn''t see them due to the cloud cover.<br/> <br/>Well done! :-)</td>', 'Superb Photo!  Congrats on the win and consider yourself graced that you were able to see them.  Here in Ontario we couldn''t see them due to the cloud cover. Well done! :-)', '2003-11-12 07:25:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(482014, 44981, 7870, '<td valign="top">This is a truly amazing photo ... I have never seen an aurora, but would love to do so while living in the northern hemisphere.  Your photo is sharp and clear and yet has vibrant colour despite the night exposure.  A very well-deserved win!</td>', 'This is a truly amazing photo ... I have never seen an aurora, but would love to do so while living in the northern hemisphere.  Your photo is sharp and clear and yet has vibrant colour despite the night exposure.  A very well-deserved win!', '2003-11-12 10:26:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(482025, 44619, 7870, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous shot, and your addition of saturation has made it extremely attractive.  It is a pity that the catasprophe of the fires took place, but even in adversity there is sometimes beauty to behold.  I love the receding rows of hilltops - your angle on them was perfect!  A very well-deserved ribbon!</td>', 'This is a fabulous shot, and your addition of saturation has made it extremely attractive.  It is a pity that the catasprophe of the fires took place, but even in adversity there is sometimes beauty to behold.  I love the receding rows of hilltops - your angle on them was perfect!  A very well-deserved ribbon!', '2003-11-12 10:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(482126, 44629, 2752, '<td valign="top">Many thanks to all who found this shot interesting and who took the time to comment.  I had fun doing it and am happy with the results.</td>', 'Many thanks to all who found this shot interesting and who took the time to comment.  I had fun doing it and am happy with the results.', '2003-11-12 11:22:05.000000', NULL, 0),
