(930817, 45009, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is another great Bobstertlobster study. I am sorry but I allowed the title to lead me and consequently I find the shot perfect bacause the walkway or pier leads the eye right into the mystic. Great tones and great angle. The cutvature adds that dynamic tension which resolves right at the convergence and blending into the horizon. The pearly sky adds a great backdrop with a subdued luminosity that is easy on the eyes. Very hood and way above average study.</td>', 'This is another great Bobstertlobster study. I am sorry but I allowed the title to lead me and consequently I find the shot perfect bacause the walkway or pier leads the eye right into the mystic. Great tones and great angle. The cutvature adds that dynamic tension which resolves right at the convergence and blending into the horizon. The pearly sky adds a great backdrop with a subdued luminosity that is easy on the eyes. Very hood and way above average study.', '2004-09-29 11:19:41.000000', NULL, 0),
